verses.text:
Enti, Onyankopɔn bɔɔ onipa sɛ ne sɛso;

Onyankopɔn sɛso so na ɔbɔɔ wɔn;

ɔbaa ne ɔbarima na ɔbɔɔ wɔn.

Nanso, ne bɛma no gyinaa pintinn,

na ne basa mu yɛɛ den;

esiane Otumfoɔ Onyankopɔn a Yakob somm no no

a ɔyɛ odwanhwɛfoɔ ne Israel botantim no;

esiane Onyankopɔn a wʼagya somm no a ɔboa wo no;

Otumfoɔ a ɔde ɔsoro nhyira bɛhyira wo;

nhyira a ɛfiri asase ase pɛɛ;

nhyira a ɛfiri nufoɔ ne yafunu mu no.

“Benyamin yɛ pataku a ɔyɛ nam;

ɔbɔ aporɔ anɔpa, kye nʼahaboa we,

na ɛduru anwummerɛ a, ɔkyekyɛ ɛnam nkaeɛ no.”

Awurade yɛ ɔkofoɔ;

Aane, ne din ne
Awurade.

“sɛ ɛyɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan,

sɛ ɛyɛ Apam Adaka, ne ahummɔborɔbea;

sɛ ɛyɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu ahyehyɛdeɛ,

sɛ ɛyɛ ɛpono no ne ɛso nneɛma;

sɛ ɛyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ kaneadua ne ɛho nneɛma;

sɛ ɛyɛ ohwam afɔrebukyia;

Obiara a ɔpɛ no mfa saa afɔrebɔdeɛ yi mu biara mmrɛ
Awurade:


“sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ, kɔbere mfrafraeɛ;

Yosef mmammarima no:

Efraim abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Amihud babarima Elisama;

Manase abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Pedahsur babarima Gamaliel;

Nkɔmhyɛ a Balaam de maaeɛ no nie:

“Balak, sɔre na tie;

Sipor babarima tie me.

na yei ne nkɔmhyɛ a ɔmaaeɛ:

“Beor ba Balaam nkɔmhyɛ no nie;

nkɔmhyɛ a ɛfiri ɔbarima a nʼani hunu adeɛ yie,

deɛ ɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm;

deɛ ɔhunu anisoadeɛ a ɛfiri Otumfoɔ hɔ;

na ɔda fam, a nʼani gu so:

Yei ne nkɔmhyɛ a Balaam de maeɛ:

“Beor ba Balaam nkɔmhyɛ no nie;

nkɔmhyɛ a ɛfiri ɔbarima a nʼani hunu adeɛ yie,

deɛ ɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm;

deɛ ɔwɔ nyansa a ɛfiri Ɔsorosoroni no

deɛ ɔhunu anisoadeɛ a ɛfiri Otumfoɔ hɔ;

na ɔda fam, a nʼani gu so:

Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔyɛ Yakob babarima panin Ruben asefoɔ:

Hanokfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hanok;

Palufoɔ abusua, wɔde too a wɔn tete agya Palu;

Mɛbɔ
Awurade din;

Animuonyam wɔ yɛn Onyankopɔn.

Ɔyɛ Ɔbotan; nʼadwuma yɛ pɛ;

Biribiara a ɔyɛ nam ne kwan so, na ɛyɛ.

Ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn nokwafoɔ a ɔnyɛ mfomsoɔ;

Ɔteneneeni ne nokwafoɔ ne no.

Nanso wɔayɛ amumuyɛsɛm atia no;

sɛ wɔyɛ saa a, na wɔyɛ ne mma anaa?

Wɔyɛ adaadaafoɔ ne nkyirimma kɔntɔnkye.

Ɛfiri sɛ, Israelfoɔ yɛ
Awurade dea;

Yakob yɛ nʼagyapadeɛ sononko.

Ɔma wɔnante faa nkokoɔ so;

Ɔma wɔdi mfuo so nnɔbaeɛ;

ɔde abotan mu woɔ,

ne ngo a ɛfiri abohemaa mu siesie wɔn.

Nanso, ankyɛre Yeshurun dɔree sradeɛ yɛɛ ahomasoɔ;

nnipa no mu yɛɛ duru, yɛɛ abrane, yɛɛ pemee!

Afei, wɔpaa Onyankopɔn a ɔbɔɔ wɔn;

wɔammu wɔn Botan a ɔyɛ wɔn nkwagyeɛ no.

Ɔkaa sɛ, “Mɛgya wɔn hɔ;

Mɛma wɔn awieeɛ aba!

Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔyɛ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ kɔntɔnkye;

mma a wɔnni nokorɛ.

Wɔde anyame foforɔ som akanyane me ninkuntwe;

wɔde anyame huhuo ahyɛ me abufuo.

Afei, mɛhyira aman a wɔnyɛ me ɔman mpo ama wɔn ani abere;

mɛhyira aman amanmufoɔ a wɔnni nteaseɛ ahyɛ wɔn abufuo.

Asɛm a Mose ka faa Aser abusuakuo ho nie:

“Aser nnya animuonyam wɔ ne nuanom anim;

ne nuanom mfa anidie mma no;

wɔmfa ngo nsra ne nan ho.

“Onyankopɔn biara nni hɔ sɛ Yeshurun Onyankopɔn;

Ɔnam ɔsorosoro bɛboa wo,

ɔde ne tumi nante omununkum mu.

Onyankopɔn a ɔwɔ hɔ daa yɛ wo dwanekɔbea;

nʼabasa a ɛwɔ hɔ daa no kura wo.

Ɔbɛpam wʼatamfoɔ afiri wʼanim;

Ɔno na ɔteaam sɛ, ‘Sɛe wɔn!’

Ɔbɛbɔ nyamesurofoɔ ho ban,

na amumuyɛfoɔ bɛyera esum mu.


“Sɛ ahoɔden mu nko deɛ a, obi renni nim;

Wɔn a wɔko tia
Awurade no, ɔbɛdwerɛ wɔn.

Ɔdwa aprannaa firi ewiem gu wɔn so;

Awurade bu atɛn wɔ asase so baabiara.


“Ɔma ne ɔhempɔn ahoɔden kɛseɛ;

deɛ wasra no no, ɔhyɛ nʼahoɔden mu den.”

Hwɛ sɛdeɛ mesu woɔ, me nua Yonatan;

Ao, hwɛ ɔdɔ a mede dɔɔ woɔ!

Na wo dɔ a wode dɔɔ me no mu dɔ;

emu dɔ sene mmaa dɔ!

Deɛ ɔtɔ so mmienu no din de Kileab a ɔyɛ Abigail a na ɔyɛ Nabal a ɔfiri Karmel no kunabaa babarima;

deɛ ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa no din de Absalom a ɔyɛ Gesurhene3.3
Gesur yɛ Siria ahemman ketewa bi a ɛhɔ na Absalom kɔpɛɛ dwanekɔbea (13.37-38; 14.23). Talmai babaa Maaka babarima.

Wɔankyekyere wo nsa;

wɔangu wo nan nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn.

Dabi, wɔdii wo awu;

amumuyɛfoɔ atirimpɔ so adeɛ.”

Nnipa no nyinaa suu Abner bio.

Na asase wosoeɛ na ɛhinhimeɛ;

ɔsoro fapem wosoeɛ;

wɔwosoeɛ, nʼabufuo enti.

Wisie firii ne hwene mu;

ogyaframa firii nʼanom;

na egyasramma dɛre firii mu.

Ɛfiri sɛ, manante
Awurade akwan so;

Mentwee me ho mfirii me Onyankopɔn ho nkɔyɛɛ bɔne.

“Womaa me nkonimdie wɔ wɔn a wɔbɔ me kwaadu so.

Woahwɛ sɛ mɛyɛ amanaman sodifoɔ;

na nnipa a mennim wɔn som me.

Ao
Awurade yei enti, mɛkamfo wo wɔ amanaman mu nyinaa;

na mɛto ayɛyie nnwom ama wo edin.

“Wode nkonimdie akɛseɛ ama wo ɔhene;

woda ɔdɔ a ɛnsa da adi kyerɛ deɛ woasra no ngo,

wode kyerɛ Dawid, ne nʼasefoɔ afebɔɔ.”

Ɛsɛ sɛ obi kɔ amia mu ansa na watwa wɔn agu;

wɔde ogya bɛhye wɔn dworobɛɛ.”


Dawid Nnɔmmarima

Wɔn a aka a wɔfra Aduasa no mu nie:


Yoab nuabarima Asahel;

Dodo a ɔfiri Betlehem babarima Elhanan;

Nnipa a na wɔka Dawid nnɔmmarima no ho nie:


Yoab nuabarima Asahel;

Dodo babarima Elhanan a ɔfiri Betlehem;

Eliel a ɔfiri Mahawi;

Elnaam mmammarima Yeribai ne Yosawia;

Yitma a ɔfiri Moab;

Na deɛ ɔtua wɔn ano yɛ Semaa a ɔfiri Gibea no babarima Ahieser. Na ne nuabarima ne Yoas a ɔyɛ nʼabadiakyire. Yeinom ne nnɔmmarima no nkaeɛ:

Asmawet mmammarima Yesiel ne Pelet;

Beraka ne Yehu a wɔfiri Anatot;

Monhoahoa mo ho wɔ ne din kronkron mu;

momma wɔn a wɔhwehwɛ
Awurade no nnya akoma mu anigyeɛ.

Momma mo ani nna
Awurade ne nʼahoɔden so;

na monhwehwɛ nʼanim ɛberɛ biara.

Ɔyɛ
Awurade, yɛn Onyankopɔn;

nʼahennie da adi wɔ asase so nyinaa.

Na wɔn edin ne:

Otni, Refael, Obed ne Elsabad;

na wɔn abusuafoɔ Elihu ne Semakia nso yɛ mmɔdemmɔfoɔ.

Mmusuakuo no ne wɔn ntuanofoɔ nie:


Ruben abusuakuo: Sikri babarima Elieser;

Simeon abusuakuo: Maaka babarima Sefatia;

Na Salomo yɛɛ nneɛma a wɔde siesie Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no mu nyinaa:


sikakɔkɔɔ afɔrebukyia;

apono a wɔde Hyiadan mu Burodo no gu so;

nanso, nnipa no bi a wɔfiri Yuda ne Benyamin mu no sane kɔtenaa Yerusalem.


Yuda abusuakuo mu nnipa no nie:

Usia babarima Ataia, Sakaria babarima, Amaria babarima, Sefatia babarima, Mahalalel babarima a ɔfiri Peres abusua mu;

Saa ɛda no nnuru sum;

mma Ɔsoro Onyankopɔn nhwehwɛ akyire kwan;

mma hann biara ntɔ ngu so.

Ma esum ne owusum nnye no mfa;

ma omununkum nkata so;

na esum mmunkam ne hann so.

Ma esum kabii nnye saa anadwo no mfa;

ma wɔnyi saa anadwo no mfiri asranna so

na wɔmmfa nhyɛ ɔbosome biara mu.

Ma nʼanɔpa nsoromma nnuru sum;

na ɔntwɛne adekyeeɛ kwa

a ɔnhunu anɔpa owia nsensaneɛ a ɛdi ɛkan,

Otumfoɔ agyan no awɔ me mu,

me honhom nom ano awuduro no;

wɔahyehyɛ Onyankopɔn ahunahuna nyinaa atia me.

“Ɛno enti meremmua mʼano;

mɛfiri me honhom ahoyera mu akasa,

mɛfiri me kra ɔyea mu anwiinwii.

“Ɛwom sɛ medi bem deɛ,

nanso memmu me ho;

abrabɔ afono me.

“Abrabɔ afono me;

enti mɛka mʼasɛm a meremfa hwee nsie

na mɛkasa afiri me kra yeadie mu.

Wode adansefoɔ foforɔ bɛtia me

na woma wʼabofuo ano yɛ den wɔ me so;

wʼakodɔm tu ba me so ɛberɛ biara.

Amumuyɛfoɔ ani bɛfira,

wɔrentumi nnwane;

na wɔn anidasoɔ bɛdane owuo ahomeguo.”

Wode nkyehoma gu me nan;

wohwɛ mʼanammɔnkwan nyinaa so yie

na wode ahyɛnsodeɛ ayeyɛ mʼanammɔn mu.

Woahyehyɛ onipa nkwa nna;

woahyɛ nʼabosome dodoɔ ato hɔ

na woahyɛ no ɛberɛ a ɔrentumi ntra.

saa ara na onipa tɔ fam na ɔnsɔre bio;

ɛnkɔsi sɛ ɔsoro bɛtwam no, nnipa rensɔre

na wɔrennyane wɔn mfiri wɔn nna mu.

Esum bɛduru wɔn;

ogyaframa bɛkusa wɔn mman,

na Onyankopɔn anom ahomeguo bɛsoa wɔn akɔ.

Onyankopɔn to hyɛ me so tete me wɔ nʼabufuo mu

na ɔtwɛre ne se gu me so;

deɛ ɔne me anya no pɔkyere nʼani hwɛ me.

Nnipa bue wɔn ano di me ho fɛw;

wɔbɔ me sotorɔ de bu me animtiaa

na wɔka wɔn ho bɔ mu de tia me.

Na biribiara kɔ yie ma me, nanso ɔdwerɛɛ me;

ɔsɔɔ me kɔn mu, too me hwee hɔ.

Ɔde me asi nʼani so;

Nʼakodɔm ba anibereɛ so;

wɔsisi mpie de tia me

na wɔtwa me ntomadan ho hyia.

Wɔbɛtwe bɛmma no firi nʼakyi,

ano hyɛnhyɛn no bɛfiri ne brɛboɔ mu.

Ehu bɛba ne so;

Bɔnhwa mu dɔteɛ yɛ no dɛ;

nnipa nyinaa di nʼakyi,

na ɛdɔm a wɔntumi nkan wɔn di nʼanim.

Ahiafoɔ no yɛ wɔn adwuma pɛ aduane

te sɛ ɛserɛ so mfunumu no;

asase wesee no so na wɔnya aduane ma wɔn mma.

Sɛ adekyeɛ hann no kɔ a, owudifoɔ no sɔre

na ɔkum ohiani ne mmɔborɔni;

adesaeɛ mu, ɔwiawia ne ho sɛ ɔkorɔmfoɔ.

Ɔwaresɛefoɔ twɛn ɛberɛ a adeɛ resa;

ɔka sɛ, ‘obiara renhunu me,’

na ɔde nʼanim hinta.

Esum mu na nnipa bubu apono wura afie mu,

na awiaberɛ mu no, wɔtoto wɔn ho ɛpono mu;

wɔne hann nni hwee yɛ.

“Nanso wɔte sɛ ahuro a ɛtɛ nsuo ani;

wɔadome wɔn kyɛfa wɔ asase no so,

enti obiara nnkɔ bobe nturo no mu.

Wɔma wɔn so berɛ tiawa bi, na afei wɔnni hɔ bio;

wɔbrɛ wɔn ase boaboa wɔn ano sɛ nnipa nyinaa;

wɔtwitwa wɔn gu te sɛ aburoo ti.

Yeinom yɛ ne nnwuma mfeafeaho;

ɔka asomusɛm brɛoo kyerɛ yɛn!

Na hwan na ɔbɛtumi ate ne tumi mmobɔmu no ase.”

Onipa ma esum ba awieeɛ;

na ɔhwehwɛ kɔ akyirikyiri asase mu

kɔpɛ dadeben wɔ esum kabii mu.

Na ɔka kyerɛɛ onipa sɛ,

“Awurade suro, ɛno ne nyansa;

na sɛ wɔkyiri bɔne a, wowɔ nteaseɛ.”

Mebɔɔ ɛkwan maa wɔn na metenaa ase sɛ wɔn ɔhene;

metenaa ase sɛ ɔhene a ɔwɔ nʼakodɔm mu;

meyɛɛ sɛ obi a ɔkyekyere agyaadwotwafoɔ werɛ.

Abusuakuo no to hyɛ me so wɔ me nifa so;

wɔsum me nan mfidie,

na wɔsisi apie tia me.

Wɔsisi mʼakwan;

na wɔnya me sɛe me

na obiara mmoa me.

Ahunahuna ma me ho dwiri me;

mʼanimuonyam atu kɔ sɛdeɛ mframa abɔ agu,

me banbɔ atu ayera sɛ omununkum.

(“Ao, sɛ anka mewɔ obi a ɔbɛtie me.

Mede me din ahyɛ mʼanoyie ase, ma Otumfoɔ no mmua me;

ma deɛ ɔbɔ me kwaadu no ntwerɛ ne soboɔbɔ.

Metwɛneeɛ wɔ ɛberɛ a morekasa,

metiee mo adwenkyerɛ;

ɛberɛ a na monhunu deɛ monka no,

meyɛɛ aso maa mo pa ara,

nanso mo mu biara antumi ankyerɛ sɛ Hiob ayɛ mfomsoɔ;

mo mu biara anyi nʼanosɛm ano.

ɔbɛhunu no mmɔbɔ na waka sɛ,

‘Monnyaa no na wankɔ damena mu;

na manya mpatadeɛ ama no,’

Wɔwuwu mmerɛ tiawa bi mu, wɔ anadwo dasuo mu;

nnipa no ho woso na wɔsene kɔ;

ahoɔdenfoɔ totɔ a ɛmfiri onipa.

Ɔde atuateɛ ka ne bɔne ho;

ɔde ahantan bɔ ne nsam gu yɛn so

na ɔma ne nsɛm a ɔka tia Onyankopɔn no dɔɔso.”

Hyɛ wo ho den sɛ ɔbarima;

mɛbisa wo nsɛm,

na wobɛyi mʼano.

“Hyɛ wo ho den sɛ ɔbarima;

mɛbisa wo nsɛm,

na ɛsɛ sɛ wobua me.

“Wokaa sɛ, ‘Tie na menkasa;

mɛbisa wo nsɛm

na ɛsɛ sɛ woma me mmuaeɛ.’

Nanso nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nte saa;

wɔte sɛ ntɛtɛ a

mframa bɔ guo.

Hunu sɛ
Awurade ayi deɛ ɔwɔ nyamesu ama ne ho;

Awurade bɛtie, sɛ mesu mefrɛ no a.

Mo bo fu a, monnyɛ bɔne;

sɛ modeda mo mpa so a,

monyɛ komm na monhwehwɛ mo akoma mu.

Wosɛe wɔn a wɔka atorɔsɛm;

Awurade kyiri

mogyapɛfoɔ ne asisifoɔ.

Sane bra, Ao
Awurade, na bɛgye me nkwa;

gye me, wo dɔ a ɛnni hwammɔ no enti.

Mʼatamfoɔ nyinaa anim bɛgu ase

na wɔn ho adwiri wɔn;

na wɔapatu de fɛreɛ asane wɔn akyi.

ɛnneɛ ma mʼatamfoɔ ntaa me na wɔmmɛto me;

ma wɔntiatia me so wɔ fam

na wɔmma me funu nna mfuturo mu.

Sɛ wansesa nʼadwene a,

ɔbɛse nʼakofena ano;

ɔbɛkuntunu ne tadua na ɔde bɛmma ahyɛ mu.

mmɔfra ne nkɔkoaa mpo de wɔn ano

kamfo wo, wʼatamfoɔ nti;

na wode bɔ atamfoɔ ne weretɔfoɔ ano.

Ɔsɛeɛ a ɛnni awieeɛ ato ɔtamfoɔ no,

woatutu wɔn nkuropɔn;

na wɔnnkae wɔn bio mpo.

Monto ayɛyie dwom mma
Awurade a ɔte ahennwa so wɔ Sion;

mompae mu nka deɛ wayɛ wɔ amanaman no mu.

Hunahuna wɔn, Ao
Awurade;

na ma wɔnhunu sɛ, wɔyɛ adasamma.

Ɔde deɛ nʼakoma hwehwɛ hoahoa ne ho;

ɔhyira ɔdifodepɛfoɔ, na ɔyi
Awurade ahi.

Ahantan enti, omumuyɛfoɔ nhwehwɛ
Awurade;

na Onyankopɔn nni ne nsusuiɛ nyinaa mu.

Nʼakwan nyinaa mu, ɔdi yie;

ɔma ne ho so, na wo mmara mfa ne ho;

na ɔdi nʼatamfoɔ nyinaa ho fɛw.

Ɔtɛ wɔ nkuraase;

ɔfiri atɛeɛ kum deɛ ɔnnim hwee,

na ɔhwɛ wɔn a ɔrepɛ wɔn akum wɔn.

Ɔte sɛ gyata a wahinta;

ɔtɛ sɛ ɔbɛkyere mmɔborɔni;

ɔkyere wɔn twe wɔn ase de wɔn kɔ ne bɔn mu.

Nanso wo, Ao Onyankopɔn, wohunu amanehunu ne ɔhaw;

na wayɛ wʼadwene sɛ wobɛhwɛ.

Mmɔborɔni de ne ho ma wo;

wo na woyɛ awisiaa ɔboafoɔ.

Bubu omumuyɛfoɔ ne ɔbɔnefoɔ aprɛ;

frɛ no na ɔmmɛbu nʼamumuyɛ ho nkontaa,

amumuyɛ a anka wɔrenhunu no.

Ao
Awurade, wotie awiɛmfoɔ adesrɛ;

wohyɛ wɔn nkuran, na wotie wɔn sufrɛ,

Ɔbɛtɔ gyaframa ne sɔfe a ɛrederɛ

agu Amumuyɛfoɔ so;

na mframa a emu yɛ hyeɛ bɛyɛ wɔn kyɛfa.

Boa yɛn,
Awurade, na nyamesurofoɔ asa;

nokwafoɔ ayera wɔ nnipa mu.

Ma
Awurade ntwa nnaadaa ano

ne tɛkrɛma biara a ɛhoahoa ne ho ntwene;

Mɛkamfo
Awurade a ɔtu me fo;

na anadwo mpo mʼakoma kyerɛkyerɛ me.

Mesu mefrɛ wo, Ao Onyankopɔn

na wobɛgye me so;

yɛ aso ma me na tie me mpaeɛbɔ.

Na me deɛ, me tenenee mu, mɛhunu wʼanim;

sɛ menyane na mehunu wo a, mʼakoma bɛtɔ ne yam.

Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ.

Awurade ne me botantim;

mʼaban ne me gyefoɔ;

me Onyankopɔn ne me botan

Ne mu na menya me hintabea.

Ɔyɛ mʼakokyɛm, me nkwagyeɛ abɛn ne mʼabandenden.

Wisie firii ne hwene mu;

ogyaframa firii nʼanom,

na egyasramma dɛre firii mu.

Woagye me afiri nnipa no ntohyɛsoɔ mu,

woayɛ me amanaman no ti;

nnipa a mennim wɔn abɛyɛ mʼasomfoɔ.

Ɛpue wɔ ɔsoro fa baabi

na atwa ne ho akɔsi ano;

biribiara nhinta ne hyeɛ.

Awurade ahyɛdeɛ tene;

ɛma akoma mu anigyeɛ.

Awurade ɔhyɛ nsɛm mu da hɔ;

na ɛbue ani.

Asase so adefoɔ nyinaa bɛdidi na wɔasɔre no;

wɔn a wɔkɔ dɔteɛ mu nyinaa bɛbu nkotodwe nʼanim,

wɔn a wɔrentumi mma nkwa mu.

Asase ne deɛ ɛwɔ mu nyinaa yɛ
Awurade dea;

ewiase ne wɔn a wɔte soɔ nyinaa wɔ no;

Me nan sisi asase tamaa so;

na dwabɔ akɛseɛ ase na mɛkamfo
Awurade.

Afei ɔbɛma me tiri so

wɔ atamfoɔ a wɔatwa me ho ahyia no so;

mede anigyeɛ bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ wɔ nʼAhyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu;

na mɛto dwom, ahyehyɛ nnwom ama
Awurade.

Twe wɔn aso wɔ deɛ wɔayɛ no so;

wɔn adwuma bɔne no so;

tua deɛ wɔde wɔn nsa ayɛ so ka

na fa deɛ ɛfata wɔn sane bra wɔn so.

Awurade nne wɔ nsuo no so;

animuonyam Onyankopɔn bobom,

Awurade bobom wɔ nsuo akɛseɛ so.

Awurade di ɔhene wɔ nsuyire so;

wɔasi
Awurade ɔhene afebɔɔ.

Ao
Awurade, woyii me firii damena mu;

wode me ho kyɛɛ me na woamma mankɔ amena mu.

Wo,
Awurade na mefrɛɛ woɔ;

wo hɔ na mesu mesrɛɛ mmɔborɔhunu sɛ:

Wodanee mʼagyaadwotwa yɛɛ no asa;

woyii mʼayitoma firii me ho

na wode anigyeɛ firaa me,

Wo mu, Ao
Awurade, na manya hintabea;

mma mʼanim ngu ase;

firi wo tenenee mu gye me.

Wo nsam na mede me kra hyɛ;

gye me bio, Ao
Awurade, Onyankopɔn nokwafoɔ.

Mekyiri wɔn a wɔsom abosom huhuo;

mede me ho to
Awurade so.

Nanso, mede me ho ato wo so, Ao
Awurade;

meka sɛ, “Woyɛ me Onyankopɔn.”

Wone me hintabea;

wobɛbɔ me ho ban wɔ amanehunu mu

na wode nkwagyeɛ nnwom atwa me ho ahyia.

Monni ahurisie na mo ani nnye wɔ
Awurade mu, mo teneneefoɔ;

monto dwom, mo a mo akoma mu teɛ.

Momfa sankuo nkamfo
Awurade;

monto dwom mma no wɔ sankuten so.

Momma asase sofoɔ nyinaa nsuro
Awurade;

na ewiasefoɔ nyinaa mfa anidie mma no.

Yɛde anidasoɔ twɛn
Awurade;

ɔyɛ yɛn ɔboafoɔ ne yɛn akokyɛm.

Mede aseda bɛma
Awurade berɛ nyinaa;

nʼayɛyie wɔ mʼanom daa.

Me kra bɛhoahoa ne ho wɔ
Awurade mu;

ma amanehunufoɔ nte na wɔn nni ahurisie.

Mo ne me nkamfo
Awurade;

momma yɛmmɔ mu nkamfo ne din!

Mefrɛɛ
Awurade na ɔgyee me so;

na ɔyii me firii mʼakomatuo nyinaa mu.

Ohiani yi frɛeɛ, na
Awurade tiee no;

na ɔgyee no firii nʼahohia nyinaa mu.

Mommra, me mma, monyɛ aso mma me;

mɛkyerɛkyerɛ mo
Awurade ho suro.

Ateneneefoɔ team su, na
Awurade tie wɔn;

ɔyi wɔn firi wɔn haw nyinaa mu.

Onipa tenenee bɛhunu amaneɛ bebree

nanso
Awurade gye no firi ne nyinaa mu;

Ao
Awurade wo ne wɔn a wɔne me di asie no nni asie;

ko tia wɔn a wɔko tia me.

Nanso, ɛberɛ a mesuntiiɛ no, wɔde anigyeɛ boaa wɔn ho ano;

ntohyɛsofoɔ twaa me ho hyiaaɛ a mennim

na wɔdii me ho nsekuro a wɔantwa so da.

Di mʼasɛm ma me wɔ wo tenenee no mu, Ao
Awurade me Onyankopɔn;

mma wɔn nhwɛ me haa nsere.

Ɔda ne mpa so mpo a, ɔbɔ pɔ bɔne;

na ɔgyaa ne ho ma bɔne ɛkwan

na ɔmpo deɛ ɛnyɛ.

Fa wʼakwan hyɛ
Awurade nsam;

na fa wo ho to ne so, na ɔno na ɔbɛyɛ:

Nanso, amumuyɛfoɔ bɛyera.

Awurade atamfoɔ bɛyɛ te sɛ wiram nhwiren;

wɔbɛtu ayera sɛ wisie.

Awurade boa wɔn na ɔgye wɔn;

ɔyi wɔn firi amumuyɛfoɔ nsam na ɔgye wɔn nkwa,

ɛfiri sɛ wɔhinta wɔ ne mu.

Ao
Awurade, deɛ merehwɛ anim nyinaa da wʼanim;

mʼapinisie nhintaa wo.

Woayɛ me nna sɛ nsateakwaa baako pɛ;

na me mfeɛ dodoɔ nyɛ hwee wɔ wʼani so.

Onipa nkwa yɛ ahomeɛ bi kɛkɛ.

Onipa redi akɔneaba nyinaa no, ɔte sɛ sunsum bi kwa;

ɔha ne ho, nanso ɔyɛ kwa;

ɔboa ahonya ano, na ɔnnim deɛ ɛbɛyɛ ne dea.

Woka nnipa anim, na wotwe wɔn aso wɔ wɔn bɔne ho;

wosɛe wɔn ahonya te sɛ nweweboa

onipa biara yɛ ahomeɛ kɛkɛ.

Mede boasetɔ twɛnee
Awurade;

na ɔhwɛɛ me, na ɔtee me sufrɛ.

Wompɛ afɔrebɔ ne ayɛyɛdeɛ,

woabue mʼaso ama mahunu;

woampɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne bɔne afɔdeɛ.

Ao
Awurade, nyi wʼahummɔborɔ mfiri me so;

ma wʼadɔeɛ ne wo nokorɛ mmɔ me ho ban daa.

Nanso meyɛ ohiani ne mmɔborɔni;

ma
Awurade nnwene me ho.

Wone me ɔboafoɔ ne me gyefoɔ;

Ao me Onyankopɔn, bra ntɛm.

Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ.

Awurade bɛbɔ ne ho ban na wakora ne kra.

Ɔbɛhyira no wɔ asase no so;

ɔrennyaa no mma nʼatamfoɔ apɛdeɛ.

Mekaa sɛ, “Ao
Awurade hunu me mmɔbɔ;

sa me yadeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ mayɛ bɔne atia wo.”

Ɛberɛ biara a obi ba me nkyɛn no,

ɔka atorɔsɛm, na nʼakoma hɔre dinsɛeɛ;

ɔfiri adi kɔ a, ɔde kɔdi nsekuro.

Nanso wo,
Awurade, hunu me mmɔbɔ;

pagya me, na mentua wɔn so ka.

Ao Onyankopɔn, bu me bem,

na ka mʼasɛm a ɛtia ɔman a wɔnnsuro wo no ma me;

gye me firi nnaadaafoɔ ne amumuyɛfoɔ nsam.

Ao Onyankopɔn, yɛde yɛn aso ate;

yɛn agyanom aka akyerɛ yɛn;

deɛ woyɛeɛ wɔ wɔn berɛ so,

wɔ tete mmerɛ no mu.

Sɔre bɛboa yɛn;

wʼadɔeɛ a ɛnsa da no enti, gye yɛn.

Wɔde “Sukooko” sankuo dwomtobea na ɛtoeɛ. Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ.

Botaeɛ bi a ɛdi mu akanyane mʼakoma

ɛberɛ a merebɔ ɔhene mmrane no;

me tɛkrɛma yɛ ɔtwerɛfoɔ kunini bi twerɛdua.

Fa wo kɛseyɛ mu kɔ wʼanim nkonimdie so

wɔ nokorɛ, ahobrɛaseɛ ne tenenee mu;

ma wo nsa nifa nna wo nnwuma a ɛyɛ nwanwa no adi.

Kurobo, pɛperɛ ne bɛwewonua hwa agye wo batakari mu nyinaa;

sankuo so nnwom a ɛfiri ahemfie a wɔde asonse asiesie ho mu

ma wʼani gye.

Ɔhyɛ ntadeɛ a wɔadi mu adwinneɛ na wɔde no kɔma ɔhene;

ne mfɛfoɔ mmaabunu di nʼakyi

na wɔde wɔn nyinaa brɛ wo.

Mɛma wɔakae wo wɔ awontoatoasoɔ nyinaa mu;

ɛno enti amanaman bɛkamfo wo daa nyinaa.

Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ.

Ɔma akodie gyae kɔsi asase ano.

Ɔbubu agyan mu na ɔsɛe pea;

ɔde ogya hye nkataboɔ.

Monyɛ komm na monhunu sɛ me ne Onyankopɔn;

wɔbɛma me so wɔ amanaman no mu,

wɔbɛma me so wɔ asase so.

Ao Onyankopɔn, wʼayɛyie duru asase ano

te sɛ wo din;

tenenee ayɛ wo nsa nifa mu ma.

Saa Onyankopɔn yi yɛ yɛn Onyankopɔn daa daa;

mpo ɔbɛyɛ yɛn kwankyerɛfoɔ akɔsi awieeɛ.

Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ.

Obiara nim pefee sɛ anyansafoɔ wu;

saa ara na nkwaseafoɔ ne agyimifoɔ nso wuo

na wɔgya wɔn ahonya hɔ ma afoforɔ.

Yɛn Onyankopɔn reba nanso ɔrenyɛ komm;

ogya a ɛhye nneɛma di nʼanim,

ahum a ɛretu atwa ne ho ahyia.

“Montie, me nkurɔfoɔ na mɛkasa,

mɛdi adanseɛ atia wo, Ao Israel;

Mene Onyankopɔn, wo Onyankopɔn no.

Wo tɛkrɛma bɔ ɔsɛeɛ ho pɔ;

ɛte sɛ yiwan a ano yɛ tahwetahwe.

Wo a wotwa nkontompo nko ara.

Ampa ara, Onyankopɔn de ɔsɛeɛ a ɛnni awieeɛ bɛbrɛ wo;

ɔbɛtwe wo afiri wo ntomadan mu na watete wo mu;

Ɔbɛtɔre wʼase wɔ ateasefoɔ asase so.

Obiara amane;

wɔn nyinaa ayɛ bɔne;

wɔn mu bi nni hɔ a ɔyɛ papa;

ɔbaako mpo nni hɔ.

Ahɔhoɔ reto ahyɛ me so.

Atirimuɔdenfoɔ repɛ me akum me;

nnipa a wɔmmfa Onyankopɔn nyɛ hwee.

wɔ deɛ mʼatamfoɔ reka

ne sɛdeɛ amumuyɛfoɔ hwɛ me haa nti;

wɔde amanehunu brɛ me;

na wɔde abufuo sopa me.

Ma owuo mmɛfa mʼatamfoɔ mpofirim;

ma wɔnkɔ damena mu anikann,

ɛfiri sɛ bɔne te wɔn mu.

Twerɛ me kwadwom to hɔ;

sese me nisuo wɔ wo nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mu.

Ɛnni deɛ woatwerɛ ato hɔ no mu anaa?

Ɔsoma firi soro hɔ bɛgye me nkwa,

ɔka wɔn a wɔtaa me anibereɛ so no anim;

Onyankopɔn soma ne dɔ ne ne nokorɛ.

Ao Onyankopɔn, mʼakoma agyina pintinn,

mʼakoma nhinhim;

mɛto dwom na mayi wo ayɛ.

Ao
Awurade, mɛyi wo ayɛ wɔ amanaman no mu;

mɛto wo ho dwom wɔ nnipa mu.

Ao Onyankopɔn, woyɛ kɛseɛ wɔ ɔsorosoro hɔ;

ma wʼanimuonyam nkata asase nyinaa so.

Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ. Wɔto no sɛdeɛ wɔto “Mma Wɔnsɛe No” sankuo nne so.

Afei nnipa bɛka sɛ, “Ampa ara, ateneneefoɔ kɔ so nya wɔn akatua;

na ampa ara Onyankopɔn bi wɔ hɔ a ɔbu ewiase atɛn.”

Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ.

Nanso, wo
Awurade, wosere wɔn;

wodi saa aman no nyinaa ho fɛw.

Ao mʼAhoɔden, mɛto ayɛyi dwom ama wo;

wo, Ao Onyankopɔn, ne mʼabankɛseɛ, me Onyankopɔn a ɔyɛ ɔdɔ.

Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ. Wɔto no sɛdeɛ wɔto “Susan Edut.”

Gilead wɔ me, Manase wɔ me;

Efraim yɛ me dadeɛ kyɛ,

ɛna Yuda yɛ mʼahempoma.

Moab yɛ me dwaresɛn,

Edom so na meto me mpaboa guo;

na meteam nkonimdie so gu Filistifoɔ so.”

Mefiri asase ano frɛ wo,

mefrɛ wo ɛfiri sɛ mʼakoma atɔ baha;

fa me kɔ ɔbotan a ɛware sene me no so.

Ao me nkurɔfoɔ, momfa mo ho nto ne so daa;

monka mo akoma mu nsɛm nyinaa nkyerɛ no,

ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn ne yɛn dwanekɔbea.

Nnipa nyinaa te sɛ home;

akɛseɛ ne nkumaa nyinaa nka hwee;

sɛ wɔkari wɔn wɔ nsania so a, wɔnka hwee;

wɔn nyinaa bɔ mu a, wɔyɛ home mu tutuo.

Wɔhyehyɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho nkuran wɔ wɔn amumuyɛ nneyɛeɛ ho,

wɔka sɛdeɛ wɔbɛsum afidie;

wɔka sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛhunu yɛn?”

Ɔbɛdane wɔn ankasa tɛkrɛma atia wɔn

na ɔde wɔn aba ɔsɛeɛ mu;

na wɔn a wɔbɛhunu wɔn nyinaa bɛbɔ wɔn tiri nko wɔ animtiabuo so.

Adasamma nyinaa bɛsuro;

wɔbɛpae mu aka Onyankopɔn nnwuma

na wɔasusu deɛ wayɛ ho.

Asase nyinaa koto wo;

wɔto ayɛyi dwom ma wo,

wɔto dwom kamfo wo din.”

Ɔmaa ɛpo yɛɛ asase kesee;

wɔnante twaa asuo no.

Mommra na yɛnni ahurisie wɔ ne mu.

Womaa yɛn atamfoɔ twi faa yɛn so;

yɛfaa ogya ne nsuo mu,

nanso wode yɛn baa baabi a nnepa abu so.

Mede mmoa a wɔadɔ sradeɛ bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ ama wo

nnwennini ayɛyɛdeɛ;

mede anantwinini ne mpapo bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ.

Nanso, ma ateneneefoɔ ani nnye

na wɔnsɛpɛ wɔn ho wɔ Onyankopɔn anim;

ma wɔn ho ntɔ wɔn na wɔnni ahurisie.

Ɔma onnibie tena mmusua mu,

na ɔde nnwontoɔ yi nneduafoɔ ma wɔde wɔn ho;

na atuatefoɔ deɛ, wɔtena asase a awo so.

Onyankopɔn nteaseɛnam yɛ ɔpedu mpem mpem

ne ɔpepem mpem mpem;

Awurade firi Sinai aba ne kronkronbea.

Yɛn Onyankopɔn yɛ Onyankopɔn a ɔgye nkwa;

na
Awurade na ɔgye yɛn firi owuo mu.

Monkamfo Onyankopɔn wɔ asafo kɛseɛ no mu;

monkamfo
Awurade wɔ Israel nipakuo no mu.

Ao
Awurade, gye me so firi wʼadɔeɛ a ɛyɛ no mu;

wʼadom enti, dane bɛhwɛ me.

ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛgye Sion nkwa

na wakyekyere Yuda nkuropɔn no bio.

Afei nnipa bɛtena mu na ayɛ wɔn dea;

Ao Onyankopɔn, yɛ ntɛm gye me nkwa;

Ao
Awurade bra ntɛm bɛboa me.

Meyɛ ohiani a menni ɔboafoɔ;

Ao Onyankopɔn, bra me nkyɛn ntɛm.

Wo ne me ɔboafoɔ ne me gyefoɔ;

Ao
Awurade, ntwentwɛn wo nan ase.

Ao
Awurade, wo mu na me dwane hinta;

mma mʼanim ngu ase da.

Ɛfiri awoɔ mu, mede me ho ato wo so;

wo na woyii me firii me maame yafunu mu.

Mɛkamfo wo daa.

Wɔka sɛ, “Onyankopɔn agya no mu;

momma yɛnti no na yɛnkyere no,

na obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛgye no.”

Ma wɔn a wɔbɔ me soboɔ no nsɛe animguaseɛ mu;

wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔpira me no

ma ahohora ne animguaseɛ nkata wɔn so.

Ao Otumfoɔ
Awurade, mɛba abɛpae mu aka wo nnwuma akɛseɛ no;

mɛpae mu aka wo nko ara tenenee akyerɛ.

Mmom woama mahunu ɔhaw bebree a ɛyɛ yea;

nanso wobɛma me nkwa bio;

na wobɛyi me bio

afiri asase ase.

Ɔbɛko ama nnipa no mu amanehunufoɔ

na woagye wɔn a wɔnni bie mma nkwa;

ɔbɛdwerɛ nhyɛsofoɔ.

Aburoo mmu so wɔ asase no so nyinaa;

nnuane mmu so wɔ nkokoɔ so,

ma nʼaba mmɔ sɛ Lebanon;

na ɛnyini sɛ mfuo so serɛ.

Yɛnhunu wo nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛyɛ nwanwa biara bio;

adiyifoɔ no nyinaa asa,

na yɛn mu biara nnim nna dodoɔ a ɛbɛdie.

Ao Onyankopɔn, yɛda wo ase,

yɛda wo ase, ɛfiri sɛ wo Din abɛn;

nnipa ka wʼanwanwadeɛ kyerɛ.

Ɔbrɛ sodifoɔ honhom ase;

na asase so ahemfo suro no.

Wɔde ma dwomkyerɛfoɔ. Wɔde ma Yedutun.

Ɛberɛ a mewɔ ahohiahia mu no, mehwehwɛɛ Awurade;

metrɛɛ me nsa a ɛmpa aba mu anadwo

na me kra ampene sɛ wɔbɛkyekye ne werɛ.

Mɛkae nneɛma a
Awurade ayɛ;

aane, mɛkae wʼanwanwadeɛ a woyɛɛ tete no.

Ao Onyankopɔn, nsuo no hunuu wo,

nsuo no hunuu wo na wɔpopoeɛ;

ebunu no mpo ho wosoeɛ.

Omununkum tɔɔ nsuo,

aprannaa gyegyee wɔ soro;

na wo bɛmma twaa ogya dii akɔneaba.

Wʼaprannaa boboom wɔ twahoframa no mu,

wʼanyinam hyerɛn ewiase;

asase popoeɛ na ɛwosoeɛ.

Yɛremfa nkame wɔn mma;

yɛbɛka akyerɛ nkyirimma;

Awurade nneyɛɛ a ɛfata nkamfo no,

ne tumi ne anwanwadeɛ a wayɛ no.

Onyankopɔn abufuo sɔree wɔn so;

ɔkum ahoɔdenfoɔ a wɔwɔ wɔn mu

twitwaa Israel mmeranteɛ guiɛ.

Ɔhwiee nʼabufuhyeɛ guu wɔn so,

abufuo, anibereɛ ne ahohia;

abɔfoɔ asɛefoɔ kuo no.

Ɔbɔɔ ɛkwan maa nʼabufuo;

na wamfa wɔn nkwa ankyɛre wɔn

mmom ɔde wɔn maa ɔyaredɔm.

Ɔpamoo amanaman a wɔwɔ wɔn anim no

na ɔkyekyɛɛ wɔn nsase no mu maa wɔn sɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ;

ɔbɔɔ Israel mmusuakuo no atenaseɛ wɔ wɔn afie mu.

Nanso wɔsɔɔ Onyankopɔn hwɛeɛ

na wɔsɔre tiaa Ɔsorosoroni no;

na wɔanni ne mmara so.

Ao Onyankopɔn, amanaman no ato ahyɛ wʼagyapadeɛ so;

wɔagu wʼasɔredan kronkron no ho fi,

wɔama Yerusalem adane mmubuiɛ.

Mfa yɛn agyanom bɔne so asotwe mma yɛn;

ma wo mmɔborɔhunu mmra yɛn so ntɛm,

na yɛwɔ ahohiahia mu.

Ma nneduafoɔ no apinisie nnuru wʼanim;

fa wo basa ahoɔden no

kora wɔn a wɔabu wɔn kumfɔ no.

Ao Israel dwanhwɛfoɔ, tie yɛn,

wo a wodii Yosef anim sɛdeɛ wɔdi nnwankuo anim;

wo a wote ahennwa so wɔ Kerubim ntam no, hyerɛn

wɔ Efraim, Benyamin ne Manase anim.

Kanyane wo tumi;

bra bɛgye yɛn nkwa.

Ao Onyankopɔn, gye yɛn bio;

ma wʼanim nhyerɛn yɛn so,

na wɔagye yɛn nkwa.

Ao Otumfoɔ Onyankopɔn, gye yɛn bio;

ma wʼanim nhyerɛn yɛn so,

na wɔagye yɛn nkwa.

Mo ahohiahia mu, mofrɛɛ me na megyee mo,

megyee mo so wɔ aprannaa mu;

me sɔɔ mo hwɛeɛ wɔ Meriba nsuo ho.

“Wɔnnim hwee, na wɔnte hwee ase.

Wɔkyinkyini wɔ esum mu;

na asase fapem nyinaa woso.

Sɛ wɔfa Baka Bɔnhwa no mu a,

wɔma hɔ yɛ nsuwansuwa;

osutɔberɛ nsuo nso de nhyira pii kata asase no so.

Ao Asafo
Awurade, Onyankopɔn tie me mpaeɛbɔ;

Ao Yakob Onyankopɔn, yɛ aso ma me.

Ɛfiri sɛ
Awurade Onyankopɔn yɛ owia ne ɛkyɛm;

Awurade hunu mmɔbɔ na ɔhyɛ animuonyam;

ɔremfa ade pa biara nkame

wɔn a wɔteneɛ.

Ao
Awurade wohunuu wʼasase mmɔbɔ;

wode Yakob ahonyadeɛ sane maa no.

Ao
Awurade, tie me mpaeɛbɔ;

tie me mmɔborɔ su.

Ao
Awurade, onyame bi nni hɔ a ɔte sɛ wo;

na wɔn nnwuma biara nto wo deɛ.

Ao Onyankopɔn, ahomasofoɔ ato ahyɛ me so;

basabasayɛfoɔ kuo repɛ me akum me,

nnipa a wɔmmfa wo nyɛ hwee no.

Dane wʼani hwɛ me na dom me;

fa wʼahoɔden ma wʼakoa

na gye wʼafenaa babarima nkwa.

Woafa me nnamfonom a wɔbɛn me afiri me nkyɛn

woama me ho ayɛ wɔn ahi.

Woaka me ahyɛ mu na mentumi nnwane;

Nanso Ao
Awurade, mesu frɛ wo sɛ boa me;

me mpaeɛbɔ duru wʼanim adekyeeɛ mu

Mɛto
Awurade adɔeɛ ho dwom daa daa;

mede mʼano bɛda wo nokorɛdie adi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nyinaa mu.

Ma Awurade yɛn Onyankopɔn adom no ntena yɛn so;

na yɛn nsa ano adwuma nyɛ yie mma yɛn

aane, yɛn nsa ano adwuma nyɛ yie.

Ɔde ne ntakra bɛkata wo so;

na ne ntaban ase na wobɛnya dwanekɔbea;

ne nokorɛ bɛyɛ wo banbɔ ne wo kyɛm.

Ɔbɛfrɛ me, na mɛgye ne so;

mɛka ne ho wɔ amanehunu mu,

mɛgye no, na mahyɛ no animuonyam.

Ao
Awurade, wo nneyɛɛ ma mʼani gye;

mede anigyeɛ bɛto dwom, wo nsa ano nnwuma enti.

Awurade di ɔhene, wɔde tumi ahentadeɛ ahyɛ no;

wɔde tumi ahentadeɛ ahyɛ
Awurade

na wɔde ahoɔden ayɛ nʼakodeɛ.

Wɔde ewiase atim hɔ pintinn;

na wɔrentumi ntutu.

Ao
Awurade, wɔdwerɛ wo nkurɔfoɔ;

wɔhyɛ wʼagyapadeɛ so.

Ao
Awurade, nhyira ne onipa a wotenetene ne so,

onipa a wokyerɛ no wo mmara no;

Nanso
Awurade yɛ mʼaban;

na me Onyankopɔn ayɛ ɔbotan a ne mu na menya ahintaeɛ.

Ɔbɛtua wɔn nnebɔne no so ka

na wɔn amumuyɛ enti, wasɛe wɔn;

Awurade yɛn Onyankopɔn bɛsɛe wɔn.

Mommra mma yɛnto dwom wɔ anigyeɛ so mma
Awurade;

momma yɛmmɔ ose mma yɛn nkwagyeɛ Botan no.

Monto dwom mma
Awurade, na monkamfo ne din;

mompae mu nka ne nkwagyeɛ no daa daa.

Momfa animuonyam ne din a ɛfata mma
Awurade;

momfa afɔrebɔdeɛ nhyɛne nʼadihɔ hɔ.

Monsɔre
Awurade wɔ ne kronkronyɛ fɛfɛ mu;

asase nyinaa momma mo ho mpopo wɔ nʼanim.

Monka nkyerɛ aman nyinaa sɛ, “Awurade di ɔhene.”

Wɔabɔ asase atim hɔ pintinn na ɛnhinhim;

ɔde pɛpɛyɛ bɛbu nnipa atɛn.

Wo, Ao
Awurade ne Ɔsorosoroni wɔ asase so nyinaa;

wɔama wo so pa ara wɔ anyame nyinaa mu.

Asase nyinaa mommɔ ose mma
Awurade,

momfa nnwontoɔ nni ahurisie;

Momfa ahosɛpɛ nsom
Awurade;

momfa anigyeɛ nnwom mmra nʼanim.

Monhunu sɛ
Awurade yɛ Onyankopɔn;

ɔno na ɔyɛɛ yɛn, na yɛyɛ ne dea;

yɛyɛ ne nkurɔfoɔ ne nʼadidibea nnwan.

Momfa aseda nhyɛne nʼapono mu

na momfa nkamfo nkɔ nʼadihɔ;

momfa aseda mma no, na monkamfo ne din.

Mɛto wo dɔ ne wo tenenee ho dwom;

Ao
Awurade, mɛto ayɛyie dwom ama wo.

Ao
Awurade tie me mpaeɛbɔ;

na ma me mmoa ho sufrɛ nnuru wʼanim.

Nanso, wo
Awurade, woyɛ ɔhene daa daa;

na wo din a ahyeta no te hɔ daa awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nyinaa mu.

Wobɛsɔre na woahunu Sion mmɔbɔ;

berɛ aduru sɛ wohunu no mmɔbɔ;

ɛberɛ a wohyɛeɛ no aso.

Amanaman no bɛsuro
Awurade din;

asase so ahemfo nyinaa bɛdi wʼanimuonyam ni.

Montwerɛ yei mma nkyirimma,

sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔn a wɔnnya nwoo wɔn bɛkamfo
Awurade;

Enti mekaa sɛ,

“Ao me Onyankopɔn, mfa me nkɔ, wɔ me nkwa nna mfimfini;

wo mfeɛ wɔ hɔ daa kɔduru awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nyinaa mu.

Ao me kra, kamfo
Awurade;

na me mu adeɛ nyinaa nkamfo ne din kronkron no.

Mɛto dwom ama
Awurade me nkwa nna nyinaa;

sɛ mete ase yi, mɛto ayɛyie dwom ama me Onyankopɔn.

Monhoahoa mo ho wɔ ne din kronkron mu;

momma wɔn a wɔhwehwɛ
Awurade no nnya akoma mu anigyeɛ.

Momma mo ani nna
Awurade ne nʼahoɔden so;

na monhwehwɛ nʼanim ɛberɛ biara.

Enti,
Awurade bo fuu ne nkurɔfoɔ;

na ɔkyirii nʼagyapadeɛ.

Monna
Awurade ase na ɔyɛ;

na nʼadɔeɛ wɔ hɔ daa.

Ao
Awurade, mɛkamfo wo wɔ aman no mu;

mɛto wo ho dwom wɔ nnipa no mu.

Gilead yɛ me dea; Manase nso saa ara;

Efraim yɛ me dadeɛ kyɛ,

Yuda yɛ mʼahempoma.

Moab yɛ me dwaresɛn,

Edom so na meto me mpaboa guo;

Filistia so na mebɔ ose.”

na amumuyɛfoɔ ne nkontompofoɔ

atu wɔn ano agu me so;

wɔde atorɔ tɛkrɛma akasa atia me.

Ma wɔnkae nʼagyanom nnebɔne wɔ
Awurade anim;

na ne maame bɔne no ntena hɔ daa.

Ɔhyɛɛ nnome sɛ atadeɛ;

ɛnonom kɔɔ ne onipadua mu sɛ nsuo,

ne ne nnompe mu sɛ ngo.

Boa me, Ao
Awurade me Onyankopɔn;

gye me sɛdeɛ wʼadɔeɛ teɛ.

Wɔbɛdome, nanso wobɛhyira;

sɛ wɔto hyɛ me so a, wɔn anim bɛgu ase,

nanso wo ɔsomfoɔ ani bɛgye.

Mede mʼano bɛma
Awurade so ayɛ no kɛseɛ;

mɛkamfo no wɔ nnipadɔm mu.

Ɔde ɔgyeɛ maa ne nkurɔfoɔ;

ɔde nʼapam sii hɔ afebɔɔ,

ne din yɛ kronkron na ɛyɛ hu.

Awurade suro yɛ nyansa mfitiaseɛ;

wɔn a wɔdi nʼahyɛdeɛ so nyinaa wɔ nhunumu pa.

Ɔno na daa ayɛyie wɔ no.

Ɔte asɛmmɔne a, ɛmmɔ ne hu;

nʼakoma atim wɔ
Awurade mu ahotosoɔ mu.

Ɔto nʼakyɛdeɛ pete aman so ma ahiafoɔ,

ne tenenee wɔ hɔ daa;

wɔbɛkae wɔn daa na wɔahyɛ wɔn animuonyam.

Omumuyɛfoɔ bɛhunu ama ayɛ no yea,

ɔbɛtwere ne se na wafɔn;

omumuyɛfoɔ tirimpɔ bɛyɛ kwa.

Wɔwɔ nsa, nanso wɔnte nka;

Wɔwɔ nan, nanso wɔnnante.

Wɔntumi mma nnyegyeeɛ bi mfiri wɔn mene mu.

Ao
Awurade, ampa ara meyɛ wo ɔsomfoɔ;

meyɛ wo ɔsomfoɔ, wʼafenaa babarima;

wayi me afiri me mpɔkyerɛ mu.

Aman nyinaa, monkamfo
Awurade;

mo nnipa nyinaa, momma ne din so.

Mʼahohiahia mu, mesu frɛɛ
Awurade;

ɔgyee me so, na ɔma me dee me ho.

Wɔkyere guu me so sɛ nwowa,

nanso wɔhyee ntɛm so sɛ nkasɛɛ a ogya atɔ mu;

Awurade din mu metwitwaa wɔn guiɛ.

Wɔapagya
Awurade nsa nifa so;

Awurade nsa nifa ayɛ nneɛma akɛseɛ!”

Bue tenenee apono ma me;

na mɛhyɛne mu na mede aseda ama
Awurade.

Monna
Awurade ase, ɛfiri sɛ ɔyɛ;

na nʼadɔeɛ wɔ hɔ daa.

Mɛdi wo ɔhyɛ nsɛm so;

na nnya me korakora.


Awurade Mmara Ho Setie

Ao
Awurade, nkamfo wɔ wo;

kyerɛkyerɛ me wo ɔhyɛ nsɛm.

Mʼani gye wo ɔhyɛ nsɛm ho;

na merentoto wʼasɛm ase.


Awurade Mmara Mu Ahotɔ

Ao
Awurade, wone me kyɛfa;

mahyɛ bɔ sɛ mɛdi wo nsɛm so.

Ao
Awurade, wʼasɛm no tim hɔ daa;

ɛgyina hɔ pintinn wɔ ɔsorosoro.

Mahunu sɛ pɛyɛ nyinaa wɔ deɛ ɛkɔpem;

nanso wo mmaransɛm no nni hyeɛ.


Awurade Mmara Ho Ɔdɔ

Menya nteaseɛ firi wo nkyerɛkyerɛ mu;

enti mekyiri ɛkwan bɔne biara.


Awurade Mmara Yɛ Kanea

Mahunu amane bebree;

kyɛe me nkwa so, Ao
Awurade, sɛdeɛ wʼasɛm teɛ.

Wo ho suro ma me ho popo;

wo mmara abɔ me hu.


Awurade Mmara No Setie

Ao
Awurade, ɛberɛ aso sɛ woyɛ biribi;

wɔrebu wo mmara so.

Wʼahyɛdeɛ yɛ nokorɛ daa;

ma me nteaseɛ na manya nkwa.


Ɔgyeɛ Mpaeɛbɔ

Tie me nne sɛdeɛ wʼadɔeɛ no teɛ;

Ao
Awurade, kyɛe me nkwa so sɛdeɛ wo mmara teɛ.

Ao
Awurade, wʼayamhyehyeɛ yɛ kɛseɛ;

kyɛe me nkwa so sɛdeɛ wo mmara no teɛ.

Hwɛ sɛdeɛ mʼani gye wo nkyerɛkyerɛ ho;

Ao
Awurade, kyɛe me nkwa so sɛdeɛ wʼadɔeɛ teɛ.

Ao
Awurade, ma me sufrɛ nnuru wʼanim;

ma me nteaseɛ sɛdeɛ wʼasɛm no teɛ.

Awurade nhyira wo mfiri Sion

wo nkwa nna nyinaa;

na ɔmma wo nhunu Yerusalem nkɔsoɔ,

Nanso
Awurade yɛ ɔteneneeni;

Watwitwa amumuyɛfoɔ nhoma afiri me ho.”

Monkamfo
Awurade ɛfiri sɛ ɔyɛ;

monto ayɛyie dwom mma ne din, na ɛno na ɛyɛ anisɔ.

Menim sɛ
Awurade so;

Ɔso sene anyame nyinaa.

Ɔma omununkum ma ne ho so firi asase ano ba;

ɔsoma anyinam ka osutɔ ho

na ɔma ahum tu firi nʼakoradan mu.

Monkamfo
Awurade, Ao Israel fiefoɔ;

monkamfo
Awurade, Ao Aaron fiefoɔ;

ɛhɔ na yɛn nnommumfafoɔ bisaa yɛn nnwom,

yɛn ahohiahiafoɔ pɛɛ yɛn hɔ ahurisie nnwom;

wɔkaa sɛ, “Monto Sion nnwom baako mma yɛn!”

Ao
Awurade, mɛfiri mʼakoma nyinaa mu ayi wo ayɛ;

mɛto wʼayɛyie dwom wɔ anyame no anim.

esum mpo nnyɛ sum mma wo;

na anadwo bɛhyerɛn sɛ awia;

esum ne hann yɛ wo pɛ.

Wɔamfa me bɔberɛ anhinta wo

ɛberɛ a wɔyɛɛ me kɔkoam no;

ɛberɛ a wɔnwonoo me asase yam no,

Ao
Awurade gye me firi nnipa bɔne nsam;

bɔ me ho ban firi basabasayɛfoɔ nsam,

Ahantanfoɔ asum me afidie;

wɔatrɛtrɛ wɔn asau nhoma mu,

wɔasunsum me mfidie wɔ me kwan so.

nyɛ amumuyɛfoɔ abisadeɛ mma wɔn, Ao
Awurade;

mma wɔn nhyehyɛeɛ nyɛ yie.

Ma nnyasrama ngu wɔn so;

ma wɔnto wɔn ngu ogya mu,

ngu atɛkyɛ amena mu a wɔrensɔre bio.

Ao
Awurade, ma ɔwɛmfoɔ nwɛn mʼano;

na wɛn mʼano ɛpono.

Nanso, Ao Otumfoɔ
Awurade, wo so na mʼani da;

wo mu na mehinta. Nnya me mma owuo.

Hwɛ me nifa so na hunu sɛ;

mʼasɛm mfa obiara ho;

menni dwanekɔbea bi;

me nkwa mfa obiara ho.

Mekae tete nna no;

medwendwene wo nnwuma

ne deɛ wo nsa ayɛ nyinaa ho.

Ao
Awurade, wo din enti, kyɛe me nkwa so;

wo tenenee mu, yi me firi ɔhaw mu.

Wɔ wʼadɔeɛ a ɛnsa da no mu, yi mʼatamfoɔ hɔ;

na sɛe wɔn a wɔkyiri me nyinaa,

na meyɛ wo ɔsomfoɔ.

Ao
Awurade, firi ɔsoro hɔ na siane bra fam;

fa wo nsa ka mmepɔ, na ɛmfiri wisie.

Ao
Awurade, wʼabɔdeɛ nyinaa bɛkamfo wo;

na wʼahotefoɔ bɛma wo so.

Mɛkamfo
Awurade me nkwa nna nyinaa;

mɛto ayɛyi dwom ama me Onyankopɔn, sɛ mete ase yi.

Yɛn
Awurade so, na ne tumi yɛ kɛseɛ;

yɛrente nʼase nwie.

Ɔde omununkum kata ɔsoro ani;

ɔde osutɔ ma asase

ma ɛserɛ nyini wɔ nkokoɔ so.

Momma
Awurade so, Ao Yerusalem;

kamfo wo Onyankopɔn, Ao Sion,

Na
Awurade ani sɔ ne nkurɔfoɔ;

ɔde nkwagyeɛ kyɛ hyɛ ahobrɛasefoɔ.

Sɛ wɔka sɛ, “Bra ma yɛnkɔ;

ma yɛnkɔtetɛ na yɛnkum obi,

ma yɛnkɔtɛ ntwɛn mmɔborɔni bi;

Saa na wɔn a wɔdi korɔnodeɛ akyi no awieeɛ teɛ;

ɛma wɔhwere wɔn nkwa!


Nyansa A Wɔpo Ho Kɔkɔbɔ

Fa wʼakoma nyinaa to
Awurade so

na mmfa wo ho nto wʼankasa nteaseɛ so;

Fa wʼahonya hyɛ
Awurade animuonyam,

ne wo nnɔbaeɛ a ɛdi ɛkan nyinaa;

Wonante a, ɛbɛkyerɛ wo ɛkwan;

sɛ woda a, ɛbɛwɛn wo;

sɛ wonyane a, ɛbɛkasa akyerɛ wo.

Wɔnam ɔdɔ ne nokorɛ so pata bɔne;

onipa nam
Awurade suro so yi bɔne akwa.

Nsania ne abrammoɔ a nsisie nni mu firi
Awurade;

nkariboɔ a ɛwɔ kotokuo mu no, ɔno na ɔyɛeɛ.

Deɛ ɔyɛ ɔsetie ma nkyerɛkyerɛ no nya nkɔsoɔ;

nhyira nka deɛ ɔde ne ho to
Awurade so.

Ɔhene akoma da
Awurade nsam;

ɔkyerɛ no ɛkwan te sɛ asutene ma ɔkɔ baabiara a ɔpɛ.

Ɔbaa waresɛefoɔ anomu yɛ amena donkudonku;

deɛ ɔhyɛ
Awurade abufuo ase no bɛtɔ mu.

Hunu nso sɛ nyansa yɛ wo kra dɛ;

sɛ wonya a, wowɔ anidasoɔ ma daakye,

na wʼanidasoɔ renyɛ kwa.

Wie wo mfikyidwuma

na siesie wo mfuo;

ɛno akyi, si wo fie.

Sɛdeɛ sukyerɛmma ma ewiem dwoɔ wɔ otwa berɛ mu no

saa ara na ɔsomafoɔ nokwafoɔ teɛ ma wɔn a wɔsoma no;

na ɔma ne wuranom akomatɔyam.

Deɛ awudie ma ne tiboa bu no fɔ no,

ɔbɛyɛ ɔkobɔfoɔ akɔsi ne wu da;

mma obiara mmɔ ne ho ban.

“Ao
Awurade, nneɛma mmienu na mehwehwɛ firi wo nkyɛn;

mfa nkame me ansa na mawu:

Yi atorɔ ne ahohwisɛm firi me mu;

mma mennyɛ ohiani anaa ɔdefoɔ;

nanso ma me deɛ medi daa.

Lemuel, nsã nyɛ mma ahemfo;

asanom nyɛ mma ahemfo,

ɛnsɛ sɛ sodifoɔ pere nsaden ho;

Kasa na bu atɛntenenee;

kasa ma ahiafoɔ ne onnibie yiedie.


Awieeɛ: Ɔyere A Ɔsom Bo

Adeɛ nnya nkyeeɛ no na wasɔre;

ɔsiesie aduane ma nʼabusuafoɔ

na ɔkyekyɛ nnwuma ma ne mmaawa.

Ɔbaa kɔnɔfoɔ yɛ nnaadaa, na ahoɔfɛ twam ntɛm so;

nanso ɔbaa a ɔsuro
Awurade no fata nkamfoɔ.

Deɛ aba no bɛba bio,

deɛ wɔayɛ no, wɔbɛyɛ bio;

adeɛ foforɔ biara nni owia yi ase.

Biribiara a ɛwɔ hɔ ɛnnɛ no, aba pɛn,

na deɛ ɛbɛba no nso aba dada;

na Onyankopɔn bɛfrɛ deɛ asi dada no ama akontabuo.

Deɛ nʼani bere sika no nnya deɛ ɛdɔɔso da;

na deɛ ɔpɛ ahonyadeɛ dodoɔ no ani nsɔ deɛ ɔnya.

Yei nso yɛ ahuhudeɛ.

Sɛ sodifoɔ bo fu wo a,

nnya wʼadwuma nto hɔ;

na ntoboaseɛ dwodwo mfomsoɔ kɛseɛ ano.

ɛberɛ a wɔatoto abɔntene no apono mu

na ayammeeɛ nnyegyeeɛ ano abrɛ ase;

ɛberɛ a nnipa te nnomaa su na wɔanyane,

nanso wɔn nnwontoɔ ano brɛ ase;

Borɔdɔma agu nhyerɛnne;

na bobe hwa agye baabiara.

Sɔre bra, me dɔfoɔ;

mʼahoɔfɛ bra me nkyɛn.”


Aberanteɛ:

Mʼaborɔnoma a wohyɛ abotan ntokuro mu

ahinta wɔ mmepɔ so,

ma me nhunu wʼanim;

ma mente wo nne;

wo nne yɛ dɛ,

na wʼanim yɛ fɛ.

Anadwo mu nyinaa, wɔ me mpa so

mehwehwɛɛ deɛ mʼakoma da no so;

mehwehwɛɛ no, nanso manhunu no.

Monhwɛ, ɛyɛ Salomo teaseɛnam a

akofoɔ aduosia bɔ no kyidɔm;

adeɛ a ɛwɔ animuonyam pa ara wɔ Israel,

Adɔdɔdeɛ firi wʼano sɛ ɛwokyɛm, mʼayeforɔ;

nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ wɔ wo tɛkrɛma ase.

Wo ntadeɛ mu hwa te sɛ Lebanon deɛ.

Maba me turo mu, me nuabaa, mʼayeforɔ;

maboaboa me kurobo ne me nnuhwam ano.

Madi me woɔkyɛm ne ɛwoɔ;

manom me bobesa ne me nufosuo.

Nnamfonom:

Ao, nnamfonom, monnidi na monnom;

Ao, adɔfonom, monnom deɛ ɛbɛmee mo.


Ababaawa:

Ne ti yɛ sikakɔkɔɔ amapa;

ne tiri so nwi yɛ kuhaa,

na ɛyɛ tuntum sɛ kwaakwaadabi.

Me dɔfoɔ yɛ me dea, na me nso me wɔ no;

ɔkyinkyin sukooko no mu.


Aberanteɛ:

Ebia na ɔyerenom yɛ aduosia,

mpenafoɔ bɛyɛ aduɔwɔtwe,

ne mmabaawa dodoɔ a wɔntumi nkan wɔn;

nanso mʼaborɔnoma a ne ho nni asɛm da mu fua;

ɔno nko ara ne ne maame babaa,

ɔno na deɛ ɔwoo no no pɛ nʼasɛm.

Mmabaawa hunu no no, wɔfrɛɛ no nhyira;

ahemaa ne mpenafoɔ kamfoo no.


Nnamfonom:

Wo tiri si so sɛ Karmel Bepɔ.

Wo tirinwi te sɛ adehyetoma a wɔadi mu adwinneɛ;

wo tirinwi tentene no dwomfa ɔhene.

Wo sodifoɔ yɛ atuatefoɔ,

akorɔmfoɔ yɔnkonom;

wɔn nyinaa pɛ adanmudeɛ,

na wɔpere akyɛdeɛ ho.

Wɔnni mma nwisiaa;

na akunafoɔ nsɛm nkɔ wɔn anim.

Mɛma me nsa so, atia mo;

mɛhohoro wo ho fi korakora

na mayi mo ho nkekaawa nyinaa.

Ɔhoɔdenfoɔ bɛyɛ sɛ adeɛ a ɛhye ntɛm;

nʼadwuma bɛyɛ sɛ ogya nturueɛ;

ne mmienu no bɛhye abɔ mu,

a obiara rentumi nnum.”

Dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ ahyɛ wɔn asase no so ma;

wɔn ademudeɛ dɔɔso bebree.

Apɔnkɔ ayɛ wɔn asase no so ma;

na wɔn nteaseɛnam dodoɔ nni ano.

Ahoni ahyɛ wɔn asase no so ma;

wɔkoto sɔre wɔn ankasa nsa ano adwuma,

deɛ wɔn nsateaa ayɛ.

Wɔbɛbrɛ ɔhantanni ase,

na wɔde nnipa ahomasoɔ ahwe fam;

Awurade nko ara na wɔbɛma no so da no.

Wɔbɛbrɛ ɔhantanni ase,

na wɔde nnipa ahomasoɔ ahwe fam;

Awurade nko ara na wɔbɛma no so da no,

Sɛdeɛ wɔn anim teɛ no di adanseɛ tia wɔn;

wɔda wɔn bɔne adi te sɛ Sodom;

wɔmmfa nsie.

Nnome nka wɔn!

Wɔakɔfa amanehunu aba wɔn ho so.

Nkabɔne bɛsi deɛ ɛyɛ hwam anan mu;

ntampehoma bɛsi nkatakɔnmu anan mu;

tire a ɛso apa bɛsi tirinwi a wɔasiesie anan mu;

ayitoma bɛsi ntoma pa anan mu;

honam ani atwaatwa bɛsi ahoɔfɛ anan mu.

Na ɔkaa sɛ, “Kɔka kyerɛ saa nkurɔfoɔ yi sɛ,

“ ‘Ɔte deɛ mobɛte, nanso morente aseɛ;

Ɔhwɛ deɛ mobɛhwɛ, nanso morenhunu.’

Wɔn mu bebree bɛsuntisunti;

wɔbɛhwe ase a wɔnnsɔre bio;

wɔbɛsum wɔn afidie na ayi wɔn.”

Woatrɛ ɔman no mu;

woama wɔn ani agye mmoroso;

wɔdi ahurisie wɔ wʼanim

sɛdeɛ nnipa di ahurisie otwaberɛ,

sɛdeɛ nnipa ho sɛpɛ wɔn

wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔrekyɛ afodeɛ.

Enti
Awurade bɛtwa etire ne dua afiri Israel ho

na ɛberɛ ne demmire nso, ɔde da koro pɛ bɛtwa;

Sɛdeɛ obi tene ne nsa hyɛ pirebuo mu no,

saa ara nso na mɛtene me nsa wɔ amanaman no ahonyadeɛ so;

sɛdeɛ wɔtase nkosua a wɔagya hɔ no

saa ara na mɛboaboaa amanaman no nyinaa ano;

obiara ammɔ ne ntaban mu,

na wammue nʼano ansu.’ ”

Ɛda no, wɔbɛyi wɔn adesoa no afiri wo mmatire so;

wɔn kɔnnua afiri wo kɔn mu;

wɔbubu kɔnnua no

na afiri mo so.

Wɔhyɛne Ayat;

wɔfa Migron;

na wɔkora wɔn nneɛma wɔ Mikmas.

Nokorɛ, Onyankopɔn ne mʼagyenkwa;

mede me ho bɛto ne so, na merensuro.

Awurade,
Awurade ne mʼahoɔden ne me dwom;

na wabɛyɛ me nkwagyeɛ.”

Mahyɛ mʼahotefoɔ;

mafrɛ mʼakofoɔ sɛ wɔnna mʼabufuhyeɛ adi,

wɔn a wɔdi me nkonimdie ho ahurisie.

Twa adwo, na
Awurade da no abɛn;

ɛbɛba te sɛ ɔsɛeɛ a ɛfiri Otumfoɔ no.

Wɔn tadua bɛbobɔ mmeranteɛ ahwehwe fam;

wɔrenhunu nkokoaa mmɔbɔ

na wɔrennya ayamhyehyeɛ mma mmɔfra.

Nnipa rentena hɔ bio

awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nyinaa mu;

Arabni biara rensi ne ntomadan wɔ hɔ;

odwanhwɛfoɔ biara remfa ne nnwan nkɔ home wɔ hɔ.

Wokaa no wʼakoma mu sɛ,

“Mɛforo akɔ soro;

mɛma mʼahennwa so

asi Onyankopɔn nsoromma atifi;

mɛtena ase adi ɔhene wɔ ahyiaeɛ bepɔ so,

deɛ ɛkrɔn paa wɔ bepɔ kronkron no so.

Wɔn nkekamu gyegye wɔ Moab ahyeɛ so;

wɔn agyaadwotwa kɔduru Eglaim

na wɔn abubuobɔ kɔduru Beer Elim.

Momma Moabfoɔ adwanefoɔ no ne mo ntena;

monyɛ wɔn banbɔ wɔ ɔsɛefoɔ no ho.”


Ɔhyɛsoni no bɛba nʼawieeɛ

na adesɛeɛ to bɛtwa;

opoobɔni no bɛyera wɔ asase no so.

Ahosɛpɛ ne anigyeɛ nni mfikyifuo no mu;

obiara nnto dwom, na ɔnteateam wɔ bobeturo mu;

obiara nnkyi nsã wɔ nsakyimena so,

ɛfiri sɛ mede nteateam aba nʼawieeɛ.

Mesi apinie wɔ mʼakoma mu wɔ Moab ho

te sɛ sankuten so kwadwom;

na me yam hyehye me ma Kir Hereset.

Nsuka bɛyi hwa;

na nsuwa a ɛwɔ Misraim bɛtwe na awe.

Demmire ne ɛserɛ bɛdwan,

Momfa nsuo mmrɛ wɔn a sukɔm de wɔn;

mo a motete Tema,

mommrɛ adwanefoɔ aduane.

Mo adikanfoɔ nyinaa abɔ mu adwane;

wɔamfa tadua ankyekyere wɔn.

Mo a wɔkyere mo nyinaa wɔfaa mo nneduafoɔ;

mo a modwanee wɔ ɛberɛ a na atamfoɔ no wɔ akyirikyiri.

Elam fa bɛmma no

ka ne nteaseɛnamkafoɔ ne apɔnkɔ ho;

Kir pagya kyɛm no.

Wɔayi Yuda ho banbɔ no.

Na da no wode wʼani too

akodeɛ a ɛwɔ Kwaeɛ mu Ahemfie no so;

Nanso hwɛ, woka sɛ anigyeɛ ne ahosɛpɛ wɔ hɔ;

wokunkum anantwie ne nnwan;

wowe ɛnam na woboro nsã!

Woka sɛ, “Momma yɛnnidi na yɛnnom,

ɛfiri sɛ, ɔkyena yɛbɛwu!”

Wɔpere nsã wɔ mmɔntene so;

ahosɛpɛ nyinaa adane bosoo yɛ,

anigyeɛ nyinaa atu ayera wɔ asase no so.

Nanso wɔn a aka no ama wɔn nne so, de anigye teateaam;

ɛfiri atɔeɛ fam, wɔkamfo
Awurade kɛseyɛ.

Woayɛ kuropɔn no mmubuiɛ sie,

kuro no a ɛwɔ banbɔ no asɛe;

ananafoɔ abandenden no nyɛ kuropɔn bio;

na wɔrensi bio.

Wɔ bepɔ yi so, ɔbɛsɛe

owuo ntoma a ɛkata nnipa nyinaa ho

ne owuo nkatasoɔ a ɛkata aman nyinaa so;

Saa ɛda no, wɔbɛka sɛ,

“Ampa ara yɛn Onyankopɔn nie;

yɛde yɛn ho too no so na ɔgyee yɛn;

Awurade no nie, yɛgyee no diiɛ;

momma yɛnni ahurisie na yɛn ani nnye wɔ ne nkwagyeɛ no mu.”

Awurade nsa bɛda saa bepɔ yi so;

nanso ɔbɛtiatia Moab so

te sɛ ɛserɛ a wɔtiatia so de fra sumena.

Ɔbɛbubu mo banbɔ afasuo atentene no agu;

ɔbɛbubu agu fam

ama ayɛ mfuturo.

Woama ɔman no ayɛ kɛseɛ, Ao
Awurade;

woama ɔman no ayɛ kɛseɛ;

woahyɛ wo ho animuonyam;

woatrɛtrɛ asase no ahyeɛ nyinaa mu.

Awurade, yɛfiri ahohia mu baa wo nkyɛn;

ɛberɛ a wotwee wɔn aso no,

na yɛntumi mmue yɛn ano mpo mmɔ mpaeɛ.

Nanso wʼawufoɔ bɛnya nkwa;

wɔn onipadua bɛsɔre.

Mo a motete mfuturo mu,

monsɔre mfa anigyeɛ nteam.

Mo bosuo te sɛ anɔpa bosuo;

asase bɛyi nʼafunu apue.

Kuropɔn a wɔabɔ ho ban no ada mpan;

atenaeɛ a wɔafiri so no wɔagya no te sɛ anweatam;

ɛhɔ na anantwie mma didie,

ɛhɔ na wɔdeda;

wɔwe ɛso nnua no mman ma ɛho yɛ kokwakokwa.

Nanso, mɛbɔ wo ho nsraban;

wobɛdi awerɛhoɔ na wato kwadwom,

wobɛyɛ sɛ afɔrebukyia so ogya.

Mede dɔm bɛtwa wo ho ahyia;

mɛsisi abantenten atwa wo ho ahyia

na afei mahyɛ otua dwumadie no ase atia wo.

Wɔsie wo wie a, wobɛkasa afiri asase mu;

mfuturo mu na wo kasa bɛfiri aba.

Wo nne bɛfiri asase no mu aba te sɛ ɔsaman deɛ;

wo kasa bɛfiri mfuturo mu aba sɛ asomsɛmka.

Awurade de nnahɔɔ ato mo so:

Wakata mo ani (adiyifoɔ no);

wakata mo tiri so (adehufoɔ no).

Ahobrɛasefoɔ bɛdi ahurisie wɔ
Awurade mu bio;

ahiafoɔ ho bɛsɛpɛ wɔn wɔ Israel Ɔkronkronni no mu.

Wɔama
Awurade so, na ɔte ɔsorosoro;

ɔde tenenee ne adeteneneeyɛ bɛhyɛ Sion ma.

Ɔbɛyɛ fapem a atim yie wɔ mo mmerɛ so,

nkwagyeɛ, nyansa ne nhunumu mmorosoɔ akoraeɛ;

Awurade suro bɛyɛ wʼademudeɛ.

Monyinsɛne ntɛtɛ,

na mo wo ɛserɛ;

mo ahome yɛ ogya a ɛhye mo.

Monhwɛ Sion, yɛn afahyɛ kuropɔn no;

mo ani bɛhunu Yerusalem,

asomdwoeɛ tenaberɛ, ntomadan a wɔnntutu;

wɔrentutu ne mpɛɛwa da,

na wɔrentete ne ntampehoma mu nso.

Wɔbɛto wɔn mu atɔfoɔ no agu,

wɔn afunu no bɛyi hwa;

wɔn mogya bɛfɔ mmepɔ no.

Mʼakofena anom deɛ ɛmee no wɔ soro;

hwɛ, ɛresiane de atemmuo aba Edom so,

wɔn a masɛe wɔn koraa no.

Ɛrennum awia anaa anadwo;

ne wisie bɛfiri a ɛtoɔ rentwa da.

Ɛbɛda mpan firi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ akɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ;

obiara remfa ho bio koraa.

Anweatam ne asase a awo no ani bɛgye;

ɛserɛ bɛdi ahurisie na ayɛ frɔmm.

Te sɛ nhwiren no,

Ka kyerɛ wɔn a wɔn akoma atu no sɛ,

“Monhyɛ mo ho den, na monnsuro;

mo Onyankopɔn bɛba,

ɔde aweretɔ bɛba;

ananmuhyɛ a ɛfiri ɔsoro

bɛba abɛgye mo nkwa.”

Na ɔkwantempɔn bɛda hɔ;

wɔbɛfrɛ no Ahoteefoɔ Kwan.

Wɔn a wɔn ho nteɛ rentu ɛkwan wɔ so;

ɛbɛda hɔ ama wɔn a wɔnante saa Ɛkwan no so;

amumuyɛfoɔ nkwaseafoɔ rennante nante so.

Mede ntoboaseɛ twɛneeɛ kɔsii ahemadakye,

nanso wɔbobɔɔ me nnompe mu te sɛ gyata;

awia ne anadwo wotwaa me nkwa so.

Damena rentumi nkamfo wo;

owuo rentumi nto wo ayɛyi nnwom;

wɔn a wɔsiane kɔ amena mu no

rentumi nya anidasoɔ wɔ wo nokorɛ mu bio.

Ampa ara aman no te sɛ nsuo sope wɔ bokiti mu;

wɔde wɔn toto mfuturo a ɛgu nsania so;

ɔkari nsupɔ te sɛ deɛ ɛyɛ mfuturo muhumuhu.

Aman nyinaa nsɛ hwee wɔ nʼanim;

ɔbu wɔn adehunu bi

a wɔnka hwee.

Nsupɔ no ahunu na wɔbɔ hu;

nsase ano ho popo.

Wɔtwi bɛn, na wɔba anim;

Nsuro, na me ne wo wɔ hɔ;

mma wʼabasam mmu, na mene wo Onyankopɔn.

Mɛhyɛ wo den, na mɛboa wo;

mede me tenenee nsa nifa bɛpagya wo.

Nanso, monnka hwee,

na mo nnwuma ho nni mfasoɔ;

deɛ ɔfa mo no yɛ akyiwadeɛ.

Hwɛ, wɔn nyinaa yɛ atorofoɔ!

Wɔn nneyɛeɛ nka hwee;

wɔn nsɛsodeɛ yɛ mframa ne basabasayɛ nko ara.

Demmire a ayɛ mmerɛ no, ɔremmu mu.

Kanea ntoma a ɛnnɛre yie no, ɔrennum.

Nokorɛ mu na ɔbɛda tenenee adi;

Ma anweatam ne ɛso nkuro mma wɔn nne so;

ma atenaeɛ a Kedar te soɔ no nsɛpɛ wɔn ho.

Ma nnipa a wɔwɔ Sela nto anigye dwom;

ma wɔn nteam mfiri mmepɔ no atifi!

Ma wɔnhyɛ
Awurade animuonyam;

na wɔmpae mu nka nʼayɛyie no wɔ nsupɔ no so.

Na afei, sei na
Awurade seɛ,

deɛ ɔbɔɔ woɔ, Ao Yakob

deɛ ɔnwonoo woɔ, Ao Israel;

“Nsuro na magye wo;

mabɔ wo din afrɛ wo; woyɛ me dea.

Nsuro, ɛfiri sɛ, meka mo ho;

mede wo mma bɛfiri apueeɛ fam aba

na maboa wɔn ano afiri atɔeɛ fam.

Monhwehwɛ deɛ atwam no mu bio mma me,

momma yɛmmɔ mu ntonto adwene wɔ asɛm no ho;

ka wʼasɛm a ɛkyerɛ sɛ wonni fɔ no.

Ɔtomfoɔ fa nʼatondadeɛ

ɔde hyehyɛ egyasramma mu;

ɔde asaeɛ bobɔ so yɛ no ohoni,

ɔde nʼabasamu ahoɔden mmorosoɔ na ɛyɛ;

ɛkɔm de no na ɔyɛ mmrɛ;

ɔnnom nsuo enti ɔtɔ baha.

Ɛyɛ deɛ onipa de sɔ ogya;

ɔde ebi ka ne ho hye,

ɔde bi sɔ ogya to burodo.

Nanso ɔde ebi sene onyame nso na ɔsɔre no;

ɔyɛ ohoni na ɔkoto no.

Wonnim hwee, na wɔnte hwee ase;

wɔasram wɔn ani so enti wɔnhunu adeɛ,

wɔato wɔn adwene mu enti wɔnte hwee ase.

Nsõ na ɔdie, nnaadaa akoma ma no yera kwan;

ɔrentumi nye ne ho, anaa ɔrentumi nka sɛ,

“Deɛ mekura wɔ me nsa nifa yi nnyɛ atorɔ anaa?”

“Monnane mmra me nkyɛn na monnya nkwa,

mo a mowɔ asase ano nyinaa;

ɛfiri sɛ mene Onyankopɔn, na obiara nni hɔ.

Wɔbɔ mu kuntun, bɔ wɔn mu ase;

wɔntumi nsi amanehunu ano,

wɔn ankasa kɔ nkoasom mu.

Monkae nneɛma a atwam no, teteete nneɛma no;

Me ne Onyankopɔn, na obi nni hɔ;

Me ne Onyankopɔn, na obiara nte sɛ me.

Mɛfrɛ anomaa a ɔkyere mmoa afiri apueeɛ fam;

afiri akyirikyiri asase so, onipa a ɔbɛhyɛ me botaeɛ ma.

Deɛ maka no, ɛno na mɛma aba mu;

deɛ madwene ho no, ɛno na mɛyɛ.

Nokorɛm, wɔte sɛ nnyentia;

ogya bɛhye wɔn.

Na wɔntumi nnye wɔn ankasa ho

mfiri egyadɛreɛ ano den no ho.

Ogyasramma biara nni ha a ɛbɛka wo hye;

ogya biara nni ha a wɔbɛtena ho ato.

Nneɛma a atwam no medii ɛkan kaeɛ,

mebɔɔ nkaeɛ, na medaa no adi;

afei mpofirim mekekaa me ho na ɛbaa mu.

Wonteeɛ, na wontee aseɛ;

ɛfiri tete nyinaa wʼaso asi.

Na menim sɛ woyɛ ɔfatwafoɔ;

wɔfrɛɛ wo otuatefoɔ firi yafunu mu.

Medin enti metwentwɛne mʼabufuo so;

mʼayɛyie enti meyi firii wo so,

sɛdeɛ mentwa wo ntwene.

“Tie me, Ao, Yakob,

Israel a mafrɛ no;

Me ne no;

Me ne Ahyɛaseɛ ne Awieeɛ.

Osukɔm anne wɔn ɛberɛ a ɔdii wɔn anim, wɔ anweatam ahodoɔ so no,

ɔmaa nsuo firi ɔbotan mu ba maa wɔn;

ɔpaee ɔbotan no mu, maa nsuo tue firii mu.

Momfa anigyeɛ nteam, Ao ɔsoro;

di ahurisie, Ao asase;

monto nnwom, Ao mmepɔ!

Na
Awurade kyekye ne nkurɔfoɔ werɛ,

na ɔbɛhunu nʼamanehunufoɔ mmɔbɔ.

“Montie me, mo a mopɛ tenenee akyiri kwan;

na mohwehwɛ
Awurade;

Monhwɛ ɔbotan a wɔtwaa mo firii mu no

ne abopaebea a wɔtuu mo firii hɔ no;

“Montie me, me nkurɔfoɔ;

monyɛ aso mma me, me ɔman:

Mmara no bɛfiri me nkyɛn akɔ;

na mʼatɛntenenee bɛyɛ hann ama aman no.

Ɛrenkyɛre, wɔbɛgyaa nneduafoɔ ahufoɔ no;

wɔrenwuwu wɔ afiase amena mu,

na aduane remmɔ wɔn.

Na yei ne deɛ Otumfoɔ Awurade seɛ:

“Ɛberɛ bi me nkurɔfoɔ kɔɔ Misraim kɔtenaa hɔ;

akyire no Asiria bɛhyɛɛ wɔn so.

“Trɛ wo ntomadan no mu;

twe wo ntomadan ntwamu no mu,

nnyae yɛ;

toa wo ntampehoma no so,

bobɔ wo mpɛɛwa no so ma ɛntim yie.

Ɛfiri sɛ wobɛtrɛ akɔ nifa ne benkum;

wʼasefoɔ bɛgye aman afa

na wɔatena wɔn nkuropɔn a asɛe no so.

Israel awɛmfoɔ yɛ anifirafoɔ,

wɔn mu biara nni nimdeɛ;

wɔn nyinaa yɛ nkraman mum,

wɔntumi mmobɔ mu;

wɔdeda hɔ na wɔsoso daeɛ,

nna yɛ wɔn dɛ.

Wɔyɛ nkraman a wɔpɛ aduane yie;

wɔnnidi mmee da.

Wɔyɛ nnwanhwɛfoɔ a wɔnni nteaseɛ;

wɔn nyinaa fa wɔn ɛkwan,

obiara pɛ nʼankasa mfasoɔ.

Wɔn a wɔnante tee no

wɔhyɛne asomdwoeɛ mu;

wɔnya ahomegyeɛ ɛberɛ a wɔadeda sɛ awufoɔ.

Wɔn nnebɔne adufudepɛ maa me bo fuiɛ;

metwee wɔn aso, na mede abufuo yii mʼani,

nso wɔkɔɔ so yɛɛ deɛ wɔn akoma pɛ.

Obiara nhwehwɛ atɛntenee;

obiara mfa nokorɛdie mmɔ ne nkuro.

Wɔde wɔn ho to nsɛmhuhuo so na wɔtwa nkontonpo;

wonyinsɛn ɔhaw na wɔwo bɔne.

Wɔtu mmirika kɔyɛ bɔne;

wɔnkyɛre opira ne awudie ho.

Baabiara a wɔbɛkɔ no, wɔsɛe hɔ pasaa.

Yɛn nyinaa pɔ so te sɛ sisire;

yɛde awerɛhoɔ kurum sɛ mmorɔnoma.

Yɛhwehwɛ atɛntenenee nso yɛnhunu bi;

ɔgyeɛ nanso ɛwɔ akyirikyiri.

Ɔkaa sɛ, “Ampa ara wɔyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ,

mmammarima a wɔrenni me hwammɔ”;

ɛno enti ɔbɛyɛɛ wɔn Agyenkwa.

Wɔtenana adamena so

na anadwo wɔsiri pɛ nkokoam;

wɔwe prakonam

na wɔn nkwansɛn mu nso, wɔayɛ nkwan a wɔde ɛnam a ɛho nteɛ ayɛ;

“Hwɛ, wɔatwerɛ ato hɔ wɔ mʼanim sɛ,

merennyɛ komm, mɛtua so ka pɛpɛɛpɛ;

mɛtua so ka agu wɔn asrɛ so,

Sɛdeɛ ɔbaa kyekye ne ba werɛ no

saa ara na mɛkyekye mo werɛ;

na mobɛnya awerɛkyekyerɛ wɔ Yerusalem.”

“Ansa na merebɔ wo wɔ awotwaa mu no, na menim wo;

ansa na wɔrebɛwo wo no, meyii wo sii nkyɛn;

meyɛɛ wo sɛ odiyifoɔ maa aman no.”

Montwa nkɔ Kitim mpoano nkɔ hwɛ,

monsoma nkɔ Kedar nkɔhwehwɛ mu yie;

monhwɛ sɛ biribi a ɛte sei asi wɔ hɔ:

Agyata abobɔ mu;

wɔapɔ no so.

Wɔasɛe nʼasase;

wɔahyehye ne nkuro ayɛ no amanfo.

“Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na woaka sɛ, ‘Meho nguu fi;

mennii Baalnom akyi’?

Hwɛ sɛdeɛ woyɛɛ wo ho wɔ bɔnhwa no mu;

dwene deɛ woayɛ no ho.

Woyɛ yoma bereɛ hoɔharefoɔ

a wotu mmirika kɔ ha ba ha,

“Me nkurɔfoɔ yɛ nkwaseafoɔ;

wɔnnim me.

Wɔyɛ mma a wɔnni adwen;

wɔnte hwee ase.

Wɔwɔ bɔneyɛ ho nyansa;

na wɔnnim sɛdeɛ wɔyɛ papa.”

Mehwɛeɛ asase no,

na ɛnni bɔbea na hwee nni so;

mehwɛɛ ɔsorosoro, na wɔn hann no nni hɔ.

Adiyifoɔ no yɛ mframa bi kɛkɛ

na asɛm no nte wɔn mu;

enti momma deɛ wɔka no mmra wɔn so.”

Sɛdeɛ nnomaa ahyɛ kɛntɛn ma no

saa ara na nsisie ahyɛ wɔn afie ma;

wɔayeyɛ adefoɔ na wɔanya tumi.

Atamfoɔ bɛba abɛtwa ne ho ahyia te sɛ nnwanhwɛfoɔ;

wɔbɛsisi wɔn ntomadan atwa ne ho ahyia

na wɔn mu biara bɛhwɛ ne kyɛfa so.”

Ɛno enti, monyɛ aso, Ao amanaman;

monhwɛ, Ao adansefoɔ,

deɛ ɛbɛto wɔn.

Afei, Ao mmaa, montie
Awurade asɛm;

monyɛ aso mma nsɛm a ɛfiri nʼanom.

Monkyerɛ mo mmammaa sɛdeɛ wɔtwa dwo;

monkyerɛ mo ho mo ho abubuo bɔ.

nanso nkurɔfoɔ no amanneɛ nka hwee;

wɔtwa dua firi kwaeɛm,

na odwumfoɔ de ne fitiiɛ asene.

Wɔde dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ hyehyɛ no;

wɔde nnadewa ne asaeɛ bobɔ si hɔ

sɛdeɛ ɛrenhwe fam.

Nanso,
Awurade ne nokorɛ Onyankopɔn no;

ɔno ne Onyankopɔn teasefoɔ, daapem Ɔhene no.

Sɛ ne bo fu a, asase woso;

na amanaman no ntumi nnyina nʼabufuhyeɛ ano.

Nanso, Onyankopɔn de ne tumi bɔɔ asase;

ɔtoo ewiase fapem wɔ ne nyansa mu

na ɔde ne nhunumu trɛɛ ɔsorosoro mu.

Onipa biara nnim nyansa, na ɔnni nimdeɛ;

sikadwumfoɔ biara anim gu ase, ɛsiane nʼahoni enti.

Ne nsɛsodeɛ yɛ atorɔ;

wɔnni ahomeɛ biara wɔ wɔn mu.

Wɔasɛe me ntomadan;

wɔatwitwa ne nhoma nyinaa mu.

Wɔafa me mma nyinaa kɔ a merenhunu wɔn bio;

anka obiara a ɔbɛsi me ntomadan

anaa ɔbɛsiesie me suhyɛ.

Ao
Awurade, menim sɛ, onipa nkwa nyɛ ne dea;

na ɛnyɛ onipa na ɔkyerɛkyerɛ nʼanammɔntuo.

Mmapɔmma soma wɔn asomfoɔ ma wɔkɔpɛ nsuo;

wɔkɔhwɛ ankorɛ mu

nanso wɔnnya nsuo.

Wɔde wɔn nsuhina sane ba a hwee nni mu;

wɔkatakata wɔn tiri so

wɔ abotuo ne abasamutuo mu.

Na sɛ wɔbisa wo sɛ, ‘Ɛhe na yɛnkorɔ’ a, ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Sei na
Awurade seɛ:

“ ‘Wɔn a wɔahyɛ owuo ama wɔn no bɛkɔ owuom;

wɔn a wɔahyɛ akofena ama wɔn no bɛtotɔ akofena ano;

wɔn a wɔahyɛ ɛkɔm ama wɔn no, ɛkɔm bɛde wɔn;

wɔn a wɔahyɛ nnommumfa ama wɔn no bɛkɔ nnommumfa mu.’

Wote aseɛ, Ao
Awurade;

kae me na hwɛ me so.

Tɔ wɔn a wɔtaa me so awere.

Wowɔ abodwokyerɛ, mma me nwu;

hwɛ sɛdeɛ wo enti wɔbɔ me ahohora.

Mennwane mfirii mʼadwuma sɛ wo dwanhwɛfoɔ;

wonim sɛ mempɛɛ abasamutuo da.

Deɛ ɛfiri mʼanom yɛ pefee wɔ wʼanim.

Yɛ aso ma me, Ao,
Awurade;

tie deɛ wɔn a wɔpam me tiri so reka!

Ɛno enti, ma ɛkɔm nne wɔn mma;

yi wɔn ma akofena.

Ma wɔn yerenom nyɛ abonini ne akunafoɔ;

ma wɔnkunkum wɔn mmarima

na wɔmfa akofena nkunkum wɔn mmeranteɛ wɔ ɔko mu.

Ao,
Awurade, woadaadaa me;

na mapene so ama woadaadaa.

Wɔtwee me da mu nyinaa;

na obiara sere me.

Nanso,
Awurade ka me ho sɛ dɔmmarima;

enti mʼataafoɔ bɛsuntisunti na wɔrentumi nnyina.

Wɔbɛdi nkoguo na wɔn anim bɛgu ase pasaa;

wɔn werɛ remfiri wɔn nsopa no da.

“Odiyifoɔ ne ɔsɔfoɔ nyinaa nsuro Onyankopɔn;

mʼasɔredan mu mpo mehunu wɔn amumuyɛsɛm,”

Awurade na ɔseɛ.

amanfrafoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ nyinaa;

Us ahemfo;

Filistifoɔ ahemfo (a ɛyɛ Askelon, Gasa, Ekron ne nnipa a wɔagya wɔn wɔ Asdod);

Wɔn mma bɛdi yie sɛ kane no,

mɛma wɔn asafo atim wɔ mʼanim;

wɔn a wɔhyɛ wɔn so nyinaa mɛtwe wɔn aso.

“ ‘Nna no mu ne saa ɛberɛ no

mɛma tenenee Duban afefɛ afiri Dawid ase;

ɔbɛyɛ deɛ ɛtene ne deɛ ɛyɛ wɔ asase no so.

“ ‘Nanso tie
Awurade bɔhyɛ, Ao, Yudahene Sedekia. Yei ne deɛ
Awurade ka fa wo ho: Worenwu wɔ akofena ano;

Amanaman no bɛte wʼanimguaseɛ;

wʼagyaadwoɔ bɛhyɛ asase so ma.

Ɔkofoɔ baako bɛsunti ɔfoforɔ so;

na wɔn baanu bɛbɔ mu ahwe ase.”

Ɛhɔ na wɔbɛteam sɛ,

‘Misraimhene Farao dwa nʼanom kwa;

nʼakwannya a ɔwɔ no atwam.’

Wɔrenkamfo Moab bio;

Hesbon mmarima bɛbɔ nʼasehweɛ ho pɔ;

‘Mommra, momma yɛn nkɔbɔ saa ɔman yi.’

Mo nso, Madmen mmarima mobɛka mo ano atom;

akofena no bɛtaa mo.

Wɔatwa Moab abɛn;

na ne basa abu,”

Awurade na ɔseɛ.

“Enti mʼakoma su sɛ atɛntɛbɛn ma Moab;

esu sɛ atɛntɛbɛn ma nnipa a wɔwɔ Kir Hereset.

Ahonyadeɛ a wɔpɛeɛ no kɔ.

“Hesbon nwunu ase

na adwanefoɔ no gyinagyina a wɔnni mmoa biara,

ɛfiri sɛ ogya bi atu afiri Hesbon;

ɛgyadɛreɛ bi firi Sihon mfimfini;

ɛhye Moabfoɔ moma,

ne ahohoahoafoɔ a wɔn ano yɛ den no ti kwankoraa.

“Edom bɛyɛ ahodwiredeɛ;

wɔn a wɔtwam hɔ nyinaa ho bɛdwiri wɔn na wɔadi ne ho fɛ

ɛsiane nʼapirakuro nyinaa enti.

Damasko ayɛ mmerɛ,

wayɛ sɛ ɔrebɛdwane;

wabɔ huboa;

ahoyera ne ɔyea akyekyere no,

ɔyea a ɛte sɛ ɔbaa a ɔrekyem wɔ awoɔ so deɛ.

“Mede ogya bɛto Damasko afasuo mu;

na ɛbɛhye Ben-Hadad aban.”


Asɛm A Ɛfa Kedar Ne Hasor Ho

“Monnwane mfiri Babilonia;

momfiri Babiloniafoɔ asase so,

na monyɛ sɛ mpapo a wɔdi nnwankuo anim.

Enti wɔbɛfom Babilonia;

wɔn a wɔfom no nyinaa bɛnya afodeɛ bebree,”

Awurade na ɔseɛ.

Na mede Israel bɛsane aba nʼankasa adidibea.

Ɔbɛdidi wɔ Karmel ne Basan;

ɔbɛmee wɔ Efraim ne Gilead nkokoɔ so.

Enti ne mmeranteɛ bɛtotɔ wɔ mmɔntene so;

wɔbɛtɔre nʼasraafoɔ nyinaa ase saa ɛda no,”

Awurade na ɔseɛ.

“Monhwɛ! Akodɔm bi firi atifi fam reba;

ɔman kɛseɛ ne ahemfo bebree,

wɔrehwanyane wɔn afiri nsase ano.

Na Babilonia yɛ sikakɔkɔɔ kuruwa wɔ
Awurade nsam;

ɔmaa asase nyinaa boroo nsã.

Aman no nom ne nsã;

ɛno enti, afei, wɔabobɔ adam.

“Ɔde ne tumi bɔɔ asase;

ɔtoo ewiase fapem wɔ ne nyansa mu

na ɔde ne nhunumu trɛɛ ɔsorosoro mu.

“Onipa biara nnim nyansa, na ɔnni nimdeɛ;

sikadwumfoɔ biara anim agu ase, ɛsiane nʼahoni enti.

Ne nsɛsodeɛ yɛ atorɔ;

wɔnni ahome biara wɔ wɔn mu.

Babilonia nnɔmmarima agyae ko;

wɔhyehyɛ wɔn aban mu.

Wɔn ahoɔden asa;

wɔayɛ sɛ mmaa.

Wɔatoto nʼatenaeɛ ahodoɔ no mu ogya,

na wɔabubu nʼapono akyi adaban.

Awurade bɛsɛe Babilonia;

ɔbɛma nʼasotuatua nnyegyeeɛ no agyae.

Atamfoɔ a wɔte sɛ ahum bɛtu sɛ nsuo akɛseɛ aba ne so;

wɔn mmobom bɛgyegye.

Ɔsɛefoɔ bi bɛba abɛtia Babilonia;

wɔbɛfa ne nnɔmmarima nnommum

na wɔbɛbubu wɔn tadua mu.

Ɛfiri sɛ
Awurade yɛ Onyankopɔn a ɔhyɛ anan mu;

ɔbɛtua so ka pɛpɛɛpɛ.

Nnipa dodoɔ a Nebukadnessar de wɔn kɔɔ nkoasom mu nie:


nʼadedie afe a ɛtɔ so nson mu,

Yudafoɔ 3,023;

Wapoma ne bɛmma te sɛ ɔtamfoɔ;

ne nsa nifa ayɛ krado.

Sɛdeɛ ɔtamfoɔ yɛ no, wakunkum

wɔn a wɔyɛ fɛ wɔ anisoɔ nyinaa;

wahwie nʼabufuhyeɛ sɛ ogya

agu Ɔbabaa Sion ntomadan so.

Wama nʼatenaeɛ ada mpan sɛ turo;

wasɛe ne dwabirem.

Awurade ama Sion werɛ afiri

nʼafahyɛ ne home nna;

wɔ nʼabufuhyeɛ mu no

wabu ɔhene ne ɔsɔfoɔ animtia.

Wʼatamfoɔ nyinaa baeɛ wɔn anom

kakraa tia wo;

wɔsere na wɔtwɛre wɔn se

na wɔka sɛ, “Yɛamene no.

Ɛda a na yɛretwɛn no nie;

Yɛatena ase ahunu.”

Meyɛɛ asredeɛ maa me nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa;

wɔto akutia nnwom

de di me ho fɛ ɛda mu nyinaa.

Nanso, seesei deɛ, wɔbiri sene wisiapunu;

na wɔnhunu wɔn yie wɔ mmɔntene so.

Wɔn wedeɛ atwintwam wɔ wɔn nnompe so;

ɛho awo wesee sɛ abaa.

Ao
Awurade, kae deɛ aba yɛn so;

hwɛ, na hunu yɛn animguaseɛ.

Wo, Ao
Awurade, di ɔhene afebɔɔ;

wʼahennwa firi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ kɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ.

Ka yɛn bata wo ho bio, Ao,
Awurade, na yɛatumi aba wo nkyɛn;

yɛ yɛn nna foforɔ sɛ tete no

Fa nankum no gu mu,

nankum a ɛyɛ akɔnnɔ no nyinaa, nnyawa ne abasa.

Fa nnompe a ɛte apɔ hyɛ no ma;

Wama ɔbrɛ no nyinaa ayɛ kwa;

emu fi dodoɔ no ankɔ,

ogya mpo antumi annyi.

Sidonfoɔ ne Arwadfoɔ na wɔhare wʼahyɛn;

wo mmarima anyansafoɔ, Ao Tiro

na wɔyɛ adwumayɛfoɔ wɔ wʼahyɛn mu.

Mɛto Misraim mu ogya;

Pɛlusum de ɔyea bɛnukanuka ne mu.

Ahum bɛbu afa Tebes so;

na Memfis bɛdi abooboo ɛda biara.

Ɔda nneɛma a emu dɔ na ɛyɛ nwanwa adi,

na ɔnim deɛ ahinta wɔ sum mu;

hann atwa ne ho ahyia.

Enti afei mɛbɔ no adagya

wɔ nʼadɔfoɔ anim;

obiara rentumi nnye no mfiri me nsam.

“Enti merekɔdaadaa no;

mede no bɛkɔ anweatam so

na makasa bɔkɔɔ akyerɛ no wɔ hɔ.

Mɛware wo afebɔɔ;

mɛyi tenenee ne atɛntenenee,

ahummɔborɔ ne ayamhyehyeɛ akyerɛ wo.

Sɛ wɔn nsã sa koraa a,

wɔtoa wɔn adwamammɔ so;

wɔn sodifoɔ ani gye aniwudeɛ ho yie.

Menim Efraim ho nsɛm nyinaa;

wɔmfaa Israel nhintaa me.

Efraim, seesei deɛ wobɔ adwaman;

na Israel aprɔ.

Israel ahantan di tia no.

Israelfoɔ, mpo Efraim suntisunti wɔ wɔn amumuyɛ mu;

Yuda nso ne wɔn sunti saa ara.

Nnanu akyiri, ɔbɛma yɛanya ahoɔden;

nansa so, ɔde yɛn bɛsi yɛn siberɛ

na yɛanya nkwa wɔ nʼanim.

Momma yɛnnye
Awurade nto mu;

momma yɛn nkɔ so nnye no nto mu.

Sɛdeɛ awia pue da biara no, ɔbɛpue;

ɔbɛba yɛn nkyɛn te sɛ osuo a ɛtɔ awɔberɛ mu

anaa osutɔberɛ mu nsuo a ɛfɔ asase.”

Mede mʼadiyifoɔ twitwaa mo mu asinasini,

mede mʼanum nsɛm kunkumm mo;

mʼatemmuo baa mo so sɛ anyinam.

Wɔn akoma te sɛ fononoo;

wɔde atirimpɔ bɔne kɔ ɔhene anim.

Wɔn nsusuiɛ bɔne no dɛɛdɛɛ anadwo mu nyinaa;

adekyeeɛ mu no, ɛdɛre te sɛ ogyaframa.

Wɔamene Israel;

afei ɔfra aman no mu

te sɛ adeɛ a ɛho nni mfasoɔ biara.

Me Onyankopɔn bɛpo wɔn,

ɛfiri sɛ, wɔannyɛ ɔsetie amma no;

Wɔbɛkyinkyini aman no mu.

Israel yɛɛ bobe a ɛretrɛtrɛ;

ɔsoo aba maa ne ho.

Ɛberɛ a nʼaba redɔɔso no,

ɔsisii afɔrebukyia bebree;

nʼasase rekɔ so yɛ yie no

ɔsiesie nʼabosom dum kronkron no.

Ɛberɛ a mepɛ no, mɛtwe wɔn aso;

aman bɛboaboa wɔn ho ano atia wɔn.

Wɔde mpokyerɛ bɛgu wɔn wɔ wɔn bɔne dodoɔ ho.

Awurade wɔ soboɔ de bɔ Yuda;

ɔbɛtwe Yakob aso, wɔ nʼakwan ho

na watua no ne nneyɛeɛ so ka.

Yakob dwane kɔɔ Aramfoɔ asase so;

Israel someeɛ de nyaa yere,

ɔhwɛɛ nnwan de tua etiri nsa.

Nanso, Efraim ahyɛ no abufuo yaayaaya;

nʼAwurade bɛma ne mogyahwiegu ho afɔdie ada ne so

na ɔbɛtua nʼanimtiabuo no so ka.

Sɛ Efraim kasa a, na nnipa ho popo;

wɔpagyaa no wɔ Israelman mu.

Nanso Baalsom enti, ɔnyaa afɔbuo na ɔwuiɛ.

Memaa wɔn aduane no, wɔdi meeɛ;

wɔmeeɛ no, wɔyɛɛ ahantan;

na wɔn werɛ firii me.

Momfira ayitoma na monni awerɛhoɔ, Ao asɔfoɔ;

mo a mosom afɔrebukyia anim, montwa adwo.

Momfira ayitoma mmɛsiri pɛ

mo a mosom Onyankopɔn anim;

ɛfiri sɛ aduane ne ahwiesa afɔrebɔdeɛ no

ɛto atwa wɔ Onyankopɔn efie.

Ɛda no aba!

Awurade ɛda no abɛn;

Ɛbɛba sɛ ɔsɛeɛ a ɛfiri Otumfoɔ hɔ.

Deɛ
Awurade ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ nie:

“Monhwehwɛ me na monnya nkwa;

Mode mo ho nyinaa ato Molek nyame,

ne mo honi Rɛfan so;

wɔyɛ ahoni a moayɛ sɛ mobɛsom wɔn.

Ɛno enti, mobɛka atukɔfoɔ a wɔdi ɛkan no ho;

na mo apontoɔ ne mo ahomegyeɛ to bɛtwa.


Awurade Kyiri Israel Ahomasoɔ

Na mekaa sɛ, ‘Wɔapam me afiri wʼanim;

nanso mede mʼani bɛkyerɛ

wʼasɔredan kronkron no bio’

Nsuo a abu afa me so no bɔɔ me hu,

ebunu no twaa me ho hyiaeɛ;

ɛpo mu wira kyekyeree me tiri ho.

Monhwɛ!
Awurade firi nʼatenaeɛ reba;

ɔresiane na ɔnante asase sorɔnsorɔmmea so.

“Monnhyɛ nkɔm,” saa na wɔn nkɔmhyɛfoɔ no ka.

“Monnhyɛ saa nneɛma yi ho nkɔm;

animguaseɛ rento yɛn.”

“Mɛboaboa mo nyinaa ano Ao, Yakob;

nokorɛm mɛka Israel nkaeɛfoɔ no nyinaa abɔ mu.

Mɛka wɔn abɔ mu te sɛ nnwan a wɔgu nnwammuo mu,

te sɛ nnwankuo a wɔwɔ adidibea;

nnipa bɛhyɛ beaeɛ ho manyamanya.

Mo a mokyiri deɛ ɛyɛ na modɔ bɔne

moworɔ me nkurɔfoɔ wedeɛ

na motete ɛnam no firi wɔn nnompe ho;

“Na afei Ao, mmepɔ, montie
Awurade soboɔ;

tie, asase nnyinasoɔ a ɛwɔ hɔ daa.

Na
Awurade wɔ asɛm a ɛtia ne nkurɔfoɔ;

ɔrebɔ Israel soboɔ.

Adefoɔ a wɔwɔ mo mu no di akakabensɛm;

mo nkurɔfoɔ no yɛ atorofoɔ

na wɔn tɛkrɛma ka nnaadaasɛm.

Asraafoɔ no akokyɛm yɛ kɔkɔɔ;

akofoɔ no hyehyɛ kɔben akotaadeɛ.

Nnadeɛ a wɔde yɛɛ nteaseɛnam no

twa nyinam nyinam sɛ da a wɔyɛeɛ no;

mpea a wapoma wɔ nnua so no rehim.

Wɔn ho yɛ hu na nnipa suro wɔn;

wɔyɛ wɔn bo so adeɛ,

de pɛ animuonyam ma wɔn ho.

“Hwɛ, wama ne ho so;

nʼapɛdeɛ ntene,

nanso ɔteneneeni firi gyidie mu bɛnya nkwa.

“Masɛe amanaman;

madwiri wɔn abandenden agu.

Wɔn mmorɔno so adeda mpan,

a obiara ntwa mu hɔ.

Wɔaseɛ wɔn nkuropɔn;

a obi biara renka.

“Mo awerɛhoɔ to bɛtwa

ɛfiri sɛ mobɛnya ɛkwan adi mo afahyɛ no;

mo anim rengu ase bio.

Tiro asi abandenden ama ne ho;

waboa dwetɛ ano te sɛ mfuturo,

ne sikakɔkɔɔ ano te sɛ dɔteɛ a ɛwɔ mmɔntene so.

Afei
Awurade bɛda ne ho adi wɔn so;

nʼagyan bɛtwa yerɛ te sɛ anyinam.

Otumfoɔ
Awurade bɛhyɛn totorobɛnto no;

ɔbɛbɔ nsra wɔ atɔeɛ fam ahum mu,

Twa adwo wo pepeaa, na ntweneduro ahwe ase;

wɔasɛe nnua a ɛwɔ animuonyam no!

Twa adwo Basan adum;

wɔabubu kwaeɛbirentuo no mu nnua no!

Tie nnwanhwɛfoɔ agyaadwoɔ;

wɔasɛe wɔn adidibea frɔmfrɔm no!

Tie agyata no mmobom;

Yordan ho nkyɛkyerɛ fɛfɛ no asɛe!


Nnwanhwɛfoɔ Mmienu

Abraham ba ne Isak,

Isak ba ne Yakob;

Yakob nso mma ne Yuda ne ne nuanom.

Ram woo Aminadab;

Aminadab woo Nahson;

Nahson nso woo Salmon.

Salmon ne ne yere Rahab woo Boas;

Boas ne ne yere Rut woo Obed;

Obed nso woo Yisai.

Salomo woo Rehoboam;

Rehoboam woo Abia;

Abia woo Asa.

Asa woo Yehosafat;

Yehosafat woo Yoram,

Yoram nso woo Usia

Usia ba ne Yotam;

Yotam ba ne Ahas:

Ahas ba ne Hiskia.

Hiskia ba ne Manase,

Manase ba ne Amon;

Amon nso ba ne Yosia.

Wɔn a wɔfiri Babilon nnommum mu baeɛ no akyi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nie:

Yekonia woo Sealtiel;

Sealtiel woo Serubabel.

Serubabel woo Abihud;

Abihud woo Eliakim;

Eliakim nso woo Asor.

Asor ba ne Sadok;

Sadok ba ne Akim;

Akim ba ne Elihud.

Elihud ba ne Eleasa;

Eleasa ba ne Matan.

Matan nso ba ne Yakob;

“Wɔte nne bi wɔ Rama.

Ɛyɛ osu ne agyaadwoɔ;

Rahel resu ne mma;

na ɔmpɛ sɛ wɔkyekyere ne werɛ,

ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnte ase bio”.


Wɔsane Ba Nasaret

Yesu asuafoɔ dumienu no din nie:


Simon a ne din baako ne Petro ne ne nua Andrea;

Yakobo ne ne nua Yohane a wɔyɛ Sebedeo mma no,

Ɔrensɛe demmire ɛyɛ mmerɛ no.

Kanea ntoma a ɛnnɛre yie no, ɔrennum;

kɔsi sɛ ɔnam atɛntenenee so de nkonimdie aba.

Deɛ enti a ɛma mekasa kyerɛ wɔn abɛbuo mu no ne sɛ:

“Wɔhunu deɛ, nanso wɔnhunu;

wɔte deɛ, na wɔnte aseɛ.

Yei maa Yesaia nkɔm a ɔhyɛɛ sɛ:

“ ‘Ɔte deɛ mobɛte, nanso morente aseɛ;

ɔhunu deɛ mobɛhunu, nanso morenhunu no, aba mu.

Yesu bisaa abarimaa no agya sɛ,
“Nna ahe ni a yadeɛ yi baa ne so?”

Abarimaa no agya buaa Yesu sɛ, “Ɛfiri ne mmɔfraase pɛɛ;

Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛbɛtumi!”

Na Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ,
“Mobɛtumi anom me kuruwa ano, na wɔde asubɔ a wɔde bɔ me no abɔ mo;

Monnkanee yei wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no mu pɛn sɛ:

“ ‘Ɛboɔ a adansifoɔ apo no,

ɛno ara na abɛyɛ ɛdan no ntweaso tiboɔ;

Eli agya ne Mattat;

Mattat agya ne Lewi; Lewi agya ne Melki;

Melki agya ne Yanai; Yanai agya ne Yosef;

Yosef agya ne Matatia; Matatia agya ne Amos;

Amos agya ne Nahum; Nahum agya ne Hesli;

Hesli agya ne Nagai;

Nagai agya ne Mahat;

Mahat agya ne Matatia; Matatia agya ne Semein;

Semein agya ne Yosek; Yosek agya ne Yoda;

Yoda agya ne Yohanan; Yohanan agya ne Resa;

Resa agya ne Serubabel; Serubabel agya ne Sealtiel;

Sealtiel agya ne Neri;

Neri agya ne Melki;

Melki agya ne Adi; Adi agya ne Kosam;

Kosam agya ne Elmadam; Elmadam agya ne Er;

Er agya ne Yosua; Yosua agya ne Elieser;

Elieser agya ne Yorim; Yorim agya ne Matat;

Matat agya ne Lewi;

Lewi agya ne Simeon;

Simeon agya ne Yuda; Yuda agya ne Yosef; Yosef agya ne

Yonam; Yonam agya ne Eliakim;

Eliakim agya ne Melea; Melea agya ne Mena;

Mena agya ne Matata; Matata agya ne Natan;

Natan agya ne Dawid;

Dawid agya ne Yisai;

Yisai agya ne Obed; Obed agya ne Boas;

Boas agya ne Sala; Sala agya ne Nahson;

Nahson agya ne Aminadab; Aminadab agya ne Admin;

Admin agya ne Arni; Arni agya ne Hesron; Hesron agya ne Peres;

Peres agya ne Yuda;

Yuda agya ne Yakob;

Yakob agya ne Isak; Isak agya ne Abraham;

Abraham agya ne Tera; Tera agya ne Nahor;

Nahor agya ne Serug; Serug agya ne Reu;

Reu agya ne Peleg; Peleg agya ne Eber;

Eber agya ne Sala;

Sala agya ne Kainan;

Kainan agya ne Arfaksad; Arfaksad agya ne Sem;

Sem agya ne Noa; Noa agya ne Lamek;

Lamek agya ne Metusela; Metusela agya ne Henok;

Henok agya ne Yared; Yared agya ne Mahalalel;

Mahalalel agya ne Kenan;

Kenan agya ne Enos;

Enos agya ne Set; Set agya ne Adam;

Adam agya ne Onyankopɔn.

Ɛfiri sɛ wɔatwerɛ sɛ,

“ ‘Onyankopɔn bɛsoma nʼabɔfoɔ

abɛbɔ wo ho ban;

Mateo,

Toma,

Yakobo a ɔyɛ Alfeo ba;

Simon, a wɔfrɛ no Selote;

Yuda, a ɔyɛ Yakobo ba;

ne Yuda Iskariot a ɔyii Yesu maeɛ no.


Yesu Sa Nyarewa

Yei ne deɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ Nnwom a ɛtɔ so mmienu mu no sɛ,

“ ‘Woyɛ me ba;

ɛnnɛ, mayɛ wʼAgya.’

Ahyɛdeɛ a Awurade de ama yɛn ne sɛ,

“‘Mɛma mo ayɛ amanamanmufoɔ nyinaa kanea;

ɛnam mo so na wɔbɛgye ewiasefoɔ nyinaa nkwa.’ ”

“Wɔn anom te sɛ damena a abue;

na wɔn tɛkrɛma ka atorɔsɛm.”

“Wɔn anofafa ka nsɛm a ɛte sɛ ɔwɔ ano borɔ.”

Dabi! Wɔatwerɛ sɛ,

“Wo enti, wɔkum yɛn daa nyinaa;

wɔbu yɛn sɛ nnwan a wɔrekɔkum wɔn.”

Na Yesaia de akokoɔduru ka sɛ,

“Wɔn a wɔnhwehwɛ me no hunuu me;

medaa me ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔmmisaa mʼase no.”

na wama amanamanmufoɔ nso akamfo no wɔ ne mmɔborɔhunu ho, sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ,

“Yei enti, mɛkamfo wo wɔ amanamanmufoɔ mu;

na mato nnwom akamfo wo din.”

Na bio,

“Amanamanmufoɔ nyinaa nyi Awurade ayɛ;

asase so aman nyinaa monkamfo no.”

Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ,

“Ɔfiri nʼakoma mu ma ahiafoɔ deɛ wɔhia;

nʼadɔeɛ no tena hɔ daa.”

Na ɛfa Ɔba no ho no, Onyankopɔn kaa sɛ,

“Ao, Onyankopɔn, wʼahennwa bɛtena hɔ daa nyinaa;

wʼAhennie yɛ atɛntenenee.

Na mmom, wɔaka no Atwerɛsɛm no mu baabi sɛ:

“Onipa ne hwan a wokae no;

na onipa ba nso ne hwan a wʼani ku ne ho?

monnyɛ asoɔden

te sɛ deɛ moyɛɛ ɛberɛ a mosɔre tiaa Onyankopɔn no;

sɛdeɛ moyɛɛ da a na mowɔ ɛserɛ so a mosɔɔ no hwɛeɛ no.

Mɛhunu wɔn mmɔbɔ wɔn bɔne ho;

na merenkae wɔn bɔne bio.”


Nhyehyɛeɛ Dada No

Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ,

“Ɛyɛ den sɛ wɔbɛgye onipa pa nkwa;

na wɔn a wɔnnye asɛm no nni ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ no deɛ, ɛdeɛn na ɛbɛba wɔn so?”

Sukɔm renne wɔn bio;

ɛkɔm renne wɔn bio.

Owia anaa ɔhyew biara renhye wɔn bio.

Sɛdeɛ ɔyɛɛ mo no, monyɛ no saa pɛpɛɛpɛ;

deɛ ɔyɛɛ mo biara no, montua ne so ka mprenu.

Nsa a ɔde maa mo no, monhyɛ no deɛ ano yɛ den mmɔho mmienu.
